{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:38.486492+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 154.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('edd782e038b843d29544d9fd9e217305', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360596, 1, 'iPilot', \"Carly's teacher, Ms. Briggs puts her in charge of the school talent show. After Freddie uploads the auditions, hosted by Carly and Sam, to the Internet, it becomes a huge sensation. So Carly and her friends decide to create a weekly variety show.\", '2007-09-08', 24, 6.8, 14, '/m2oPJCwlvhbXQa1neQ4EUhQQZhj.jpg', None, 'bf9c90e699704f02a1954164b39a694d', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360599, 2, 'iWant More Viewers', \"It's Carly and Sam versus Freddie and Spencer in the ultimate competition to see who can attract more viewers to the show. Things go crazy when they carry out their plans.\", '2007-09-08', 24, 7.1, 7, '/uYR1WaxbeRFxZdvt7MCCUknvEGu.jpg', None, '99d5d9ba74894368ab58c0f4eb5d9403', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360600, 3, 'iDream of Dance', 'Carly and Sam get inspiration to dance from dance videos sent by fans of their web show. Carly struts her stuff in a dream with her charming partner.', '2007-09-16', 24, 5.9, 7, '/e4VPT1ZODAeSQvZzavFmKVAJZ61.jpg', None, '0c83fdcd542c470e8db3fea72c1aecb5', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360601, 4, 'iLike Jake', \"After Jake, Carly's crush, agrees to sing a song on the webcast, Carly gets extremely excited. But, it is soon discovered that Jake is a terrible singer, so Carly asks Freddie to digitally enhance Jake's performance.\", '2007-09-22', 24, 6.1, 9, '/9TiHybisHZ1yBGq8PAUx0oyEoXk.jpg', None, 'e9bd324082de4191ab4d2a1677798315', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd' ... 200 parameters truncated ... '/4SKRaQWrYYsTRQ3ClBqrSeGDxhB.jpg', None, '65c0fd2872a64554a6deca37b98a4726', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360627, 22, 'iFence', \"Freddie's in need of some guy time, so he tags along with Spencer to go fencing. Freddie's a natural, but things get complicated when Spencer gets hi ... (152 characters truncated) ... ncing, she might not get much help. Sam reveals that she has never read a real book, and a bet begins between her and Freddie: can Sam finish a book?\", '2008-05-10', 24, 6.3, 3, '/2d4q2HfKWDPTRzLbNKhdWW4qBho.jpg', None, '9523b751ed524f299bd6e6537f165056', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360631, 23, 'iCarly Saves TV', \"A television programming director realizes that iCarly is funnier than anything his network currently has available for the upcoming fall lineup. Unf ... (36 characters truncated) ...  the network takes it further and further away from Carly's original vision, and exploits and torments Freddie more than Sam and his mother combined.\", '2008-06-13', 24, 5.7, 3, '/vPyehdWN5DxvFylZRwqxTMBns3F.jpg', None, '659360b266454214afec9cc63f4c86f1', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360628, 24, 'iWin A Date', 'Carly tries to get her web show viewers to take a boy in her school on a date.', '2008-07-25', 24, 6.3, 3, '/fj9bkchVKSRwRUI6FAAROKmGGBi.jpg', None, '03201ed44c534740a9ee13cfe299550f', '60c65c9747e445d1aa93ce7702152ffd', 360621, 25, 'iHave a Lovesick Teacher', \"Lauren Ackerman, Carly's history teacher has become an emotional wreck after her boyfriend dumps her, and she takes her heartache out on everybody in ... (271 characters truncated) ... oon Spencer, Carly, Sam, and Freddie find that it's going to take a lot more than just a little loving to keep the teacher happy, and her class safe.\", '2008-07-25', 24, 6.3, 3, '/k2yYz3ezRagAsUvbCpPIrrkJR7s.jpg', None)"}
