{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:38.669398+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 155s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d3f0d0a6ecb94113bb6c8f9ec0b8f200', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360633, 1, 'iSaw Him First', 'In the second-season opener, Carly and Sam both develop a crush on Freddie\\'s \"nerd\" pal, Shane. When they cannot decide who should date him, they de ... (291 characters truncated) ...  iCarly studio to the basement when he finds out that Sam and Carly are competing for him. When the gang visits him at the hospital Carly kisses him.', '2008-09-27', 24, 5.8, 4, '/bW7wej3P3y6Jz2iOGrwqOZ1gEVm.jpg', None, '47404b8cdd914e5ea4fe99b1573f2a75', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360647, 2, 'iStage an Intervention', 'Spencer finds a Pak-Rat video game cabinet in a junkyard and becomes addicted to it, whilst procrastinating on a commissioned Labradoodle sculpture.  ... (156 characters truncated) ...  of Pak-Rat. Meanwhile, Freddie experiences a streak of \"bad luck\" after deleting and not forwarding a chain email, passing it off as a superstition.', '2008-10-04', 24, 6.3, 3, '/9MqFJy9U5V3ak351Tv348wiWqzv.jpg', None, '28c81691fe8b4e62a71d371c8be29ec0', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360648, 3, 'iOwe You', \"Sam owes Carly and Freddie $526, so she gets a job to earn the money, and pay them back. Carly, Sam, and Freddie make a broadcast on iCarly to all th ... (402 characters truncated) ...  and Freddie then hire someone to give the money they earned to Sam in a tip. At the end, everyone enjoys what Sam got with her money except Spencer.\", '2008-10-11', 24, 6.7, 3, '/dhakmffdW2kfvwuOYiLECYdIg2h.jpg', None, '106e865daf6c475c831cff5b5eed3805', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360649, 4, 'iHurt Lewbert', \"Lewbert, Carly's doorman, is injured during an exploding muffin basket prank. Spencer suggests that Carly, Sam, and Freddie help him until he's back  ... (144 characters truncated) ... erned. Freddie's mother and Lewbert fall in love. Meanwhile, while using a CB radio, Spencer upsets two truckers nicknamed Porkchop and Sledgehammer.\", '2008-10-18', 24, 6.0, 3, '/u1iQvD6uNKwH40juhQO4CMZbdhY.jpg', None, 'f007430fa1174928a8a677f0c0de7c49', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9' ... 200 parameters truncated ... '/y6FDf10AdAP3pHATxbpwnUEyMop.jpg', None, '4d2baaeb527141d7aef7e5fb0eca3eab', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360672, 22, 'iMust Have Locker 239', \"Sam and Freddie are forced to share a big locker after they both answered how many Fat Cakes that were in the inside the container. Meanwhile, Carly  ... (485 characters truncated) ... ing laser eye surgery. As a result, locker 239 gets destroyed, courtesy of Mrs. Puckett's reckless driving, Freddie gets in trouble for the incident.\", '2009-06-27', 24, 6.5, 4, '/3Y9AuWoQRtYsKdJ4gn9RkgFNXwy.jpg', None, '0eb10a6a30c148438a0798a2b4602159', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360665, 23, 'iTwins', \"Freddie tries to prove that Melanie, Sam's twin sister, is just Sam in disguise. Meanwhile, when Carly tutors Spencer's nemesis, Chuck, Spencer tries to convince her that Chuck is evil.\", '2009-07-11', 24, 6.5, 4, '/uhzPCFMc2mwaFcxEytn0liKxhYP.jpg', None, '4cbae2d5392043d290fdd4363e1af080', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360667, 24, 'iFight Shelby Marx (1)', \"When Carly jokingly challenges MMA fighter Shelby Marx to fight, the two agree to have an exhibition fight for charity. Unfortunately, Carly accident ... (7 characters truncated) ... lls on Shelby's grandmother during a press conference. Thinking Shelby wants revenge, Carly backs out of the fight, only to be ridiculed as a coward.\", '2009-08-08', 24, 5.6, 5, '/joB3wb8R70qrwtoDfdPGdHLyOhJ.jpg', None, '5a1c6b839b094563affdafad3d0b5b9d', '162724d43fcb4ff5855c448595e383d9', 360670, 25, 'iFight Shelby Marx (2)', \"Carly visits Shelby and apologizes, and the fight is back on. However, when Nevel Papperman alters a clip of the press conference to make it look like Carly intentionally tackled Shelby's grandma, Shelby becomes furious and genuinely attacks Carly during their boxing match.\", '2009-08-08', 24, 6.0, 1, '/3U9o5Zcvrkdhw27gHWbZz106lEY.jpg', None)"}
