{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:39.255721+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 155.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('32453a4ab3064d3e8298e31ce613e88f', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360739, 1, 'iApril Fools', 'Carly and Spencer are being evicted from their apartment, and the gang reminisces about their time in Bushwell Plaza. Although, their memories may not be quite how we remember them.', '2012-03-24', 24, 6.0, 2, '/JjRDNzDI0cpBAa3TGYH6gZaHZn.jpg', None, '8367a04cbd224e15b060b054fba53793', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360740, 2, 'iGo One Direction', 'One Direction has accepted an invitation to perform on iCarly. Band member Harry becomes sick and Carly dotes over him. Realizing Harry is playing si ... (59 characters truncated) ... the group by telling him Gibby has become their newest band member. Meanwhile, Spencer becomes a personal trainer and gives a bratty girl a makeover.', '2012-04-07', 24, 7.333, 3, '/saM8wyBTWBnFOd8wPbQzgMlDJXn.jpg', None, '7d308a47ff2a4aa583a2877f76b0caa2', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360741, 3, 'iOpen a Restaurant', 'Sam and Gibby secretly operate a restaurant in the basement at school, while Spencer creates a security robot that goes haywire.', '2012-04-21', 24, 6.5, 2, '/2y4Z7JHWrjnSohpA96SXyAk1xAo.jpg', None, '703d87fd92904d59bdbe77796b41a763', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360742, 4, 'iHalfoween', 'Carly, Sam, and Freddie wonder why people can\\'t celebrate Halloween more than once a year. They decide to celebrate it halfway through the year as well creating a new holiday termed \"Halfoween\" and have a party.', '2012-04-28', 24, 5.0, 2, '/gWqN4adVVCQd1PuRwaQEneifwqT.jpg', None, '00559fd9b4d843b0b79df772daa62e29', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/3UILNqtzMomZq21OdyMZfcUFbGN.jpg', None, 'a4b3b9733c0f4cfd8e2b52decc2a5cce', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360748, 10, 'iRescue Carly', \"Sam's friend gets out of juvy and Sam warns everyone to stay away, but Carly doesn't listen and finds herself in over her head. Back at the loft, Spencer finds a pair of night vision goggles.\", '2012-10-28', 24, 5.5, 2, '/kaAGS2Sp2JURQyjAASfGBKgtPkr.jpg', None, 'f5b3b056cd8846e4b76fbe38e902b30a', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360749, 11, 'iLost My Head in Vegas', 'When Sam learns her Mom is in a Vegas jail, the gang decides to gather their most prized possessions, drive to Vegas and pawn their stuff to make enough money to bail her out.', '2012-11-04', 24, 6.0, 2, '/mpMo8a2ga2uwbCd7bk6qx5SHsPP.jpg', None, 'de7ab3b9eff44ee3bc4d938f6d73fced', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360750, 12, 'iBust a Thief', \"When Sam's laptop gets stolen, the iCarly gang tries to help track down the thief. Meanwhile, Spencer can't visit his favorite arcade unless he's accompanied by a child. His luck turns when Guppy needs a babysitter.\", '2012-11-11', 24, 7.0, 3, '/qLVczEpr5AvvYGg2XCZQ2isMJSp.jpg', None, 'a6a8f81666e14dbf9b71067230fdedd6', '4481363d76e44b53ba2459c1edcf1a43', 360751, 13, 'iGoodbye', 'Carly is sad when her father cannot escort her to a military dance. Sam and Spencer fix a motorcycle. Gibby gets his head stuck in an \"artificial head machine\" (because he sold his first one at the pawn shop). Freddie gets a new phone.', '2012-11-24', 47, 6.0, 2, '/joTnG0gE7T2aumLd0KWpPP8vVdQ.jpg', None)"}
