{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.012570+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 156.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3c7d2e7119524cbca959a077afcaa73c', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64965, 1, 'Pilot', \"Jay has just recently married his younger, Colombian wife, Gloria, but he's having trouble keeping up with her and her son Manny. Claire is having tr ... (27 characters truncated) ... especially with her husband Phil, who thinks he can be hip with his three kids. Also, Mitchell and his partner Cameron adopt a Vietnamese baby, Lily.\", '2009-09-23', 23, 7.727, 55, '/zJeQFHYYu8XHMk5JbWPXJ4Vgo7U.jpg', None, '7412f978ff264e568ea10f88e8341f15', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64966, 2, 'The Bicycle Thief', 'Phil is determined to help Luke prove to mom that he is responsible  enough to have the brand new bike they just got him. However Phil ends  up being ... (51 characters truncated) ... is judgment.  Meanwhile Mitchell and Cameron take Lily to their first Mommy &amp; Me  class, and Jay and Manny have some awkward father and son time.', '2009-09-30', 22, 7.622, 41, '/xzydcqxzJXs3hZlQYjSNBzSsv5p.jpg', None, '278b8707211649a887c5f9bdb463fe9e', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64954, 3, 'Come Fly with Me', 'Phil pushes Jay to go out with him and fly his new model plane. While Manny takes time out to play with Luke, Gloria accompanies Alex in shopping for a dress. Later on, Manny ends up having a heart-to-heart talk with his sister Claire.', '2009-10-07', 22, 7.707, 41, '/vdX9s2SocVArXs64fMPUU9qKymP.jpg', None, '9db7a625a3d545e0a1da5817438e3b4b', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64969, 4, 'The Incident', 'Claire and Mitchell\\'s mother, Dede, drops in for a surprise visit and is determined to make amends with everyone she offended during what has been d ... (40 characters truncated) ... s wedding. Needless to say, no one is thrilled to see her and everything comes to a head when the whole family shows up to dinner at Claire\\'s house.', '2009-10-14', 22, 7.705, 39, '/vKkVu42KFX2JEKe9BxeptXF4VAB.jpg', None, '30a676f51e0248b6bb8d7abdec6b8647', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/1ERgBolOUI0GrREl7KxkCZmrYCJ.jpg', None, '9d8c38ed01c64d08a884091d30a82eae', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64955, 21, 'Travels with Scout', \"Claire is caught off guard when Phil's father shows up in an RV with a little four legged friend, and she becomes suspicious that he might be hiding  ... (100 characters truncated) ...  enthusiastically offers to fill in, and Jay and Gloria have to pay the consequences of accidentally taking Manny to see a traumatizing horror movie.\", '2010-04-28', 22, 7.606, 33, '/g5xnGOHRSXChxbkvEb1BCkrApGO.jpg', None, '93e4dcd47b9f42f3a8d8bdd8199e48d2', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64959, 22, 'Airport 2010', \"For Jay's birthday, Gloria gives him the best surprise -- a romantic birthday getaway to Hawaii -- the only kicker is she invited the whole entire family to come along. Everyone arrives at the airport, and it's a maddening scene with forgotten I.D.'s, security breaches and flying phobias.\", '2010-05-05', 21, 7.576, 33, '/pPiza7G0qhGpysHZx7vgx96dXdz.jpg', None, '8b491d3d5f6e4dc6ace1627e458996db', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64962, 23, 'Hawaii', 'Jay could not be more excited to do nothing but indulge and relax in this  tropical paradise, but then an unexpected reality check dampens his  plans ... (87 characters truncated) ... meron have opposing views on whether to sightsee  or not to sightsee, and the kids get into a little bit of mischief when  left to their own devices.', '2010-05-12', 22, 7.939, 33, '/9vP2C3CqEVLztHJC2pDJC84ElGb.jpg', None, 'c8a124fb9e564bedb61507946775234c', '5f27ffd9f02342e68d4bd9198b44168f', 64963, 24, 'Family Portrait', 'Claire painstakingly plans for a new family portrait to be taken, but it seems like everything and everybody is working against her. Gloria and Manny ... (94 characters truncated) ... on; Luke interviews Jay for a school project, and Cameron gets a gig as a wedding singer while Mitchell is home alone with Lily and a wayward pigeon.', '2010-05-19', 22, 8.063, 32, '/lZ8t2VovMW8ed2K82uWzaly8q0d.jpg', None)"}
