{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.227038+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 156.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bba29a593618464db14322fd252d3bd8', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64976, 1, 'The Old Wagon', 'Phil finally agrees to sell the old station wagon but only after a family trip down memory lane; Cameron asks Jay for help when Mitchell decides to build a life-size princess castle for Lily.', '2010-09-22', 22, 7.868, 34, '/qHfOf3uktsUdsHR1vyxwmPFGB5Y.jpg', None, 'c94309d13afd43a0815f4c61de2a114c', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64978, 2, 'The Kiss', \"Gloria decides to honor her late grandmother by cooking more traditional Colombian meals; Claire finds out Alex is interested in a boy; Mitchell's aversion to public displays of affection causes an argument.\", '2010-09-29', 22, 7.571, 28, '/iC1DUbBZGE4p9EZ2MQkRNGtKOiG.jpg', None, 'db17672393d4410b812d9eef26ed4bab', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64979, 3, 'Earthquake', 'When an earthquake hits, Claire gets stuck in the bathroom with the plumber; Manny experiences an existential crisis while out with Jay; Mitchell and Cameron use the quake as an excuse to get out of a party thrown by a friend (Nathan Lane).', '2010-10-06', 22, 7.516, 31, '/pgK2Fp2B1QZrazT0tIqjjN2jnKK.jpg', None, '242de5d696bb42aa972231c0219a9b27', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64977, 4, 'Strangers on a Treadmill', \"Claire tries to stop Phil from embarrassing himself at a realtors' banquet by giving an unfunny speech, while Mitchell tries to convince Cameron to change his wardrobe. Meanwhile, Jay and Gloria go to a quinceañera hosted by one of his employees, and Haley gives Alex advice on how to be cool.\", '2010-10-13', 22, 7.5, 30, '/d529eKlwDcCY6FzMuHqjdRr2Ied.jpg', None, '3f2bc421f86b4dd88835ed41a2569637', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/AvZpYEdJJ1C0ClWHrzTPKRtxPYt.jpg', None, '8f80fafd531d4d0e881ceeebca4b12d7', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64995, 21, \"Mother's Day\", \"Claire and Gloria's Mother's Day excursion outdoors with the kids turns into the mother of all disasters. Meanwhile, Phil and Jay share an awkward moment when they stay home to prepare dinner for everyone, and Cameron worries about gender roles in his relationship with Mitchell.\", '2011-05-04', 21, 7.672, 29, '/2nys85jP73RnOPuobC99b0bCBr7.jpg', None, '820d6a9bd284490eb1d043ba50f4b9bd', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64997, 22, 'Good Cop, Bad Dog', \"Jay advises a dog trainer, while Phil and Claire switch parenting duties to the kids' chagrin. Mitchell has an extra Lady Gaga ticket when Cameron ends up sick.\", '2011-05-11', 22, 7.621, 33, '/3wyAfIn72Rq5WRA8bS4pJVc3aaB.jpg', None, '1e221a4e23c1465ab59e65e9a9002099', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64998, 23, 'See You Next Fall', \"The whole family is gathering at Jay's before heading out to Alex's graduation ceremony from middle school, but while at the house, Jay is preoccupie ... (158 characters truncated) ... zes Claire on her impending breakdown over the kids growing up too fast. All of this, plus a faulty gate, could mean their missing Alex's big moment.\", '2011-05-18', 22, 7.621, 33, '/5X6fuVXBZCX7KYTRQ4gRCL7TYlc.jpg', None, 'b4654a3cc9144a388df0be11dfd29f76', '75857884f155434a8b2aea7136dcc0fb', 64999, 24, 'The One That Got Away', 'Jay wants to go fishing on his birthday, but the family insists he have a big party, leading Claire and Mitchell to get trapped in their childhood yard, Phil to encounter his college nemesis at the mall and Cameron to have trouble at the bakery.', '2011-05-25', 22, 7.682, 33, '/ioVkF0DkhyxNYbuubWJjr9oLbhI.jpg', None)"}
