{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.389949+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 156.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('eb8bf993874b43a3a979a873f88d5cf0', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65001, 1, 'Dude Ranch', 'While vacationing on Lost Creek Ranch, the three families try their hands at a little cattle herding, skeet shooting and horseback riding. There are also some big firsts, a huge surprise and an actual face-off between Jay and a cowboy named Hank.', '2011-09-21', 22, 7.586, 35, '/d7BRZAfZTpMWDT0sW5Tgvbb64tl.jpg', None, 'b4a1f24e04b1435a98448cfc98f52535', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65000, 2, 'When Good Kids Go Bad', \"Mitchell and Cameron plan an evening with the whole family to break the happy news that they're attempting to adopt another child. However, things go wrong when they realize Lily may not take well to another baby in the house. Meanwhile, Claire and Jay are each focused with proving a point.\", '2011-09-21', 22, 7.806, 31, '/hbA2enmj4cZqqBGokk97gO7N9nV.jpg', None, '7048030232e8426e8521329e9ad84dc1', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65002, 3, 'Phil on Wire', \"Jay's relationship with the dog irritates Gloria. Phil and Luke try to master the tightrope. Cameron starts a juice fast.\", '2011-09-28', 22, 7.867, 30, '/463Wst0qwVsqdmGWtgGxzlsEhjg.jpg', None, '80cdbbf8b5bb4b8696ebdae9bfcf3fe3', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65004, 4, 'Door to Door', 'Jay helps Manny with a school fundraiser. Claire petitions for a stop sign at a busy intersection. Phil and Luke try to create a viral video. Gloria searches for Stella.', '2011-10-05', 22, 7.5, 31, '/40HdB4h5Y8OYRdNh7M5ueOjnhKN.jpg', None, 'a20e05a16a4248bea3b96e5c09289cb8', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/ivIOUyyN1GU9HeBdmsTDW070pHt.jpg', None, 'aa1bce368aa14e5ca3b18630b2c63f92', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65019, 21, 'Planes, Trains and Cars', 'Phil buys a car without consulting Claire. Jay is on a mission to get to his high-school reunion with Gloria and Manny. Lily loses her favorite toy on a train.', '2012-05-02', 21, 7.407, 27, '/isePXuyFgPwAk5oVHaDkbnlVPmB.jpg', None, '116c6ab69f8b417ebcd5f82664d468a8', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65021, 22, 'Disneyland', \"When the family travels to Disneyland, Phil struggles to keep up with Luke, Claire is shocked when they run into Dylan, Jay and Gloria disagree about what are sensible shoes for the day, and Mitch and Cam must contain Lily's new affinity for running.\", '2012-05-09', 22, 7.607, 28, '/xLXDDBJ0zzd9ACsq4qZgylxQGq5.jpg', None, 'd28ade1c5fd34a0bbb2768ece21fa150', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65022, 23, 'Tableau Vivant', \"Gloria and Jay bicker while trying to order lunch at a diner. Claire and Cam have different theories on how to discipline kids. Luke accepts an award ... (65 characters truncated) ...  his temporary job at the real estate agency. The entire family participates in Alex's living art display of Norman Rockwell's Thanksgiving painting.\", '2012-05-16', 22, 7.538, 26, '/uwKh3IyXFG9ngh3Ci1srt7n2u6n.jpg', None, '2c56ae20f83c4ffeae340ae859d71901', '81c57a8984f04f5aad2e9c386ef9d7bc', 65023, 24, 'Baby on Board', \"Gloria's bilingualism comes in handy on Mitchell and Cameron's quest to adopt another child. Meanwhile, Jay and Manny help Lily get ready for a dance recital. Alex goes to her first prom, and Haley announces her future plans, which come as a shock to her family.\", '2012-05-23', 22, 7.931, 29, '/sLtih4SIjqyehyjXOEEjziAx9QO.jpg', None)"}
