 share the wonders of residential real estate with Luke and Manny's classmates for career day. Gloria challenges Jay's claims of always wanting to become a novelist. Mitch and Cam make a costly mistake while executing tooth fairy duties.\", '2013-05-01', 22, 7.444, 27, '/vTovGQlvYm3sOqz2jQekS8Lne3J.jpg', None, 'dacfcbb8071f4746a9eeebbab3162c30', '8acc81c548ff414cb4e4bf8169272f96', 65047, 22, 'My Hero', \"Mitch's ex-boyfriend, a personable and successful doctor, invites the whole family to a fundraising event at a roller rink; Phil teaches Gloria how to skate; Haley helps Alex talk to boys.\", '2013-05-08', 22, 7.654, 26, '/A9QsyKoxyFBbhMUzRFlWBIJ2oMJ.jpg', None, '5a000e8d3c414684a674ed83e458eb82', '8acc81c548ff414cb4e4bf8169272f96', 65049, 23, 'Games People Play', \"Phil gets a new RV for a fun family road trip. Jay and Gloria search for Manny's backpack. Lily's gymnastics meet brings out Cam and Mitch's competitive spirit.\", '2013-05-15', 22, 7.8, 25, '/dyu5hw3xddHub9Ll418uhBceqj0.jpg', None, '3d3d56d67fcf4c2f84f38713cfac5691', '8acc81c548ff414cb4e4bf8169272f96', 65040, 24, 'Goodnight, Gracie', \"Everyone flies down to Florida to be with Phil after his mom's passing. Claire helps Phil with Gracie's last wish for Frank, and the kids reflect on  ... (97 characters truncated) ... ida, Cam finds himself fitting right into an elderly women's group at Frank's retirement community, and Jay runs into a pivotal person from his past.\", '2013-05-22', 22, 8.038, 26, '/sdrKGyf846173WH2JfGRSKC8TLv.jpg', None)"}
