{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.704920+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 763 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.705079+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 157.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('7f596624c2f8406ab0ca5333ad473dd6', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 65050, 1, 'Suddenly, Last Summer', \"The family is in the throes of summer activities: Phil and Claire are trying to orchestrate a kid-free week by coordinating Luke's camp with Haley's  ... (25 characters truncated) ... unteering excursion; Jay and Gloria are getting Manny ready for his first solo trip back to Colombia; and Mitch and Cam make it a summer to remember.\", '2013-09-25', 22, 8.086, 35, '/hHk1AaDx4zhUduUX29MzsyMxNhV.jpg', None, '0936aebca09f4f169c110d4c392c1a58', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 65051, 2, 'First Days', \"Luke and Manny have their first day at high school, which proves to be harder for Phil and Gloria than for the boys. Elsewhere, Claire makes her big  ... (96 characters truncated) ... starts a new substituting gig at the high school, leaving Mitch to try to juggle Lily's first day of pre-school and a very important meeting at work.\", '2013-09-25', 22, 7.422, 32, '/tdrikm9C6WiipPuDXPErDtG5b9V.jpg', None, 'cca072cee746497f9274b4e2f85ead83', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 65052, 3, \"Larry's Wife\", \"Phil's job takes up a lot of his time; Luke has his friends over for a poker game; Gloria worries the baby is cursed; Cam hosts a funeral for the cat's imaginary wife.\", '2013-10-02', 22, 7.5, 30, '/kkbxcQxN0x1Nzyrc7I4sX4MmrdY.jpg', None, '9ba68741744e4f938006b6dfbe0d4f8f', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 65053, 4, 'Farm Strong', \"Cam's sister comes to town with good news, Phil and Claire agree to skip Luke's soccer game, Gloria refuses to admit she needs glasses, and Alex thinks Jay is cheating at Words With Friends.\", '2013-10-09', 22, 7.643, 28, '/aZPg4CAEYcF3U9rM3DZzQQCyyM7.jpg', None, '793e95e875884bb78e9a69020eacbe4f', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/e6z21qNTKMryOoh8Sd2oin81gDE.jpg', None, '19ba13d782844d62929f7abac7524d67', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 974710, 21, 'Sleeper', \"Phil fails at his one task to stay home and wait for the repairman, forcing him to tell an elaborate lie to hide the truth from Claire, but the stres ... (109 characters truncated) ... nsible for organizing this year. Claire accuses Cam of being too snobby to use her girls' hand-me-downs and Jay secretly enters Stella in a dog show.\", '2014-04-30', 22, 7.407, 27, '/1mcITkTwlrdFC4AZi5TSmMQfJz3.jpg', None, '0487d002f779404db3b1d7dbb1f3371c', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 975275, 22, 'Message Received', \"Jay, Gloria and Manny challenge each other to step outside their comfort zone and try something new. Mitch and Cam's wedding is getting too big and costly so they resort to selling a couple of their prized possessions, and the kids play a joke on Phil and Claire.\", '2014-05-07', 22, 7.889, 27, '/z3Xqh6QlNmF6uY0zL8QKHkQEHop.jpg', None, 'a650485e61a54471ba7019bd937f5ca0', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 975402, 23, 'The Wedding (1)', 'Mitch and Cam\\'s big day is finally here and nothing can ruin it, until nothing turns into a whole lot of somethings and puts wedding planner extraor ... (34 characters truncated) ... t. Meanwhile, Jay and Gloria host the Tuckers, Phil squeezes in an eye procedure before the festivities and Claire embraces her role as “best woman\".', '2014-05-14', 22, 7.731, 26, '/53yfDmJTjTc0UoDKiwwkQPvo71B.jpg', None, '0dd221fa84584a9e9519e3aba1539132', '508a54846ac1454ea3f324cd2861005e', 975403, 24, 'The Wedding (2)', \"The wedding day chaos continue as the entire party shifts from one contingency plan to another. Guests start to get testy, Mitchell and Cameron are feeling discouraged and poor Claire shows physical wear and tear, but an unexpected turn of events leads to the ceremony we've all been waiting for.\", '2014-05-21', 22, 7.808, 26, '/y5gRd6RehVmFayVjBkWFG2h5bEf.jpg', None)"}
