{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:40.923515+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 157.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('8002105b1e244ed4ac463c60ad7181b9', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1000648, 1, 'The Long Honeymoon', \"Cameron isn't ready to conclude his honeymoon with Mitchell after their wedding. Gloria takes Jay to task over his appearance. The Dunphys must ready themselves for the return to school.\", '2014-09-24', 22, 7.547, 32, '/jQRnLJ5h174ZaYum5dN26Hy7L8C.jpg', None, '134956ff2c3d4abbb91805a908a5d5e5', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1007890, 2, 'Do Not Push', 'Phil, Luke, and Haley cause nothing but aggravation for Alex when they tag along on her tour of Caltech. Jay and Gloria have trouble finding the perfect gifts for their anniversary.', '2014-10-01', 22, 7.034, 29, '/9zjPFUJWiAe0FhivjygSIQCidM7.jpg', None, 'bbdddca9df8348c9ad7a86b2f52419ef', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1007891, 3, 'The Cold', \"The Dunphys are down with a cold, thanks to Phil. Jay and Gloria try to help Manny deal with playing football, and Cameron doesn't know how much playtime to give him. Mitchell debates with Lily's new friend, Sydney.\", '2014-10-08', 22, 7.214, 28, '/lMj91ueN0WtEu3L2pYiTScvo1F9.jpg', None, 'a68761f3a48e4c28a0726b0828a67a38', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1007892, 4, 'Marco Polo', \"Things become tense when the Dunphys temporarily move into a hotel, Gloria is suspicious of Manny's new girlfriend, and Mitchell discovers that he has jinxed Cameron's football team.\", '2014-10-15', 22, 7.296, 27, '/u1dANY5qv8JHWFXRYMSfhqdqiAR.jpg', None, 'afd702298eaa4292b17c438bfd3533fc', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/gsLtEMMbgUrZBZlQdnZgVyvxy9H.jpg', None, '1071f7e4eb894f02a134a8da069cdabe', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1054941, 21, 'Integrity', 'Jay and Phil try to stand up for themselves on the home front while Haley attempts it at work.', '2015-04-29', 22, 7.435, 23, '/pVkWPbDsOlW9L8utEphLllPBm2k.jpg', None, 'ae96edbd88d340888e4e5e9a5c205e05', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1056372, 22, 'Patriot Games', \"Alex learns she has to share valedictorian honors with a rival, but the tie could be broken by a 1-mile run for a gym grade neither has completed. Me ... (48 characters truncated) ...  test, but is distracted by a visit from Javier; and Mitchell and Cameron join a protest against a restaurant where they actually can't wait to dine.\", '2015-05-06', 22, 7.058, 26, '/6SZb8BlHrfChVGX9bNpN7KzWmYM.jpg', None, '162c9f09f57141489b14eb7672cbcdc1', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1056373, 23, 'Crying Out Loud', 'Claire gets a job offer from a big hotel chain, but can\\'t tell if Jay wants her to take it or keep working for him. Meanwhile, Phil, Haley and Luke  ... (55 characters truncated) ... she is; and Manny is dopey from pain killers after having his wisdom teeth pulled, so Gloria seizes the opportunity to get rid of his new girlfriend.', '2015-05-13', 22, 7.5, 24, '/8TeafoNUr82sBFrlepl8GMSH3ow.jpg', None, 'd8258d61dfc14710b681affc1cb4e5f3', '4837d8284fb043be8dd1bac885002af2', 1060817, 24, 'American Skyper', \"The sixth season ends with Alex's graduation party at Jay and Gloria's house, but Phil is stuck in Seattle on a business trip, so he uses the latest  ... (131 characters truncated) ... rstayed his welcome, Mitchell keeps the news of his layoff a secret from Cameron, and a visit from Andy's girlfriend turns Haley's world upside down.\", '2015-05-20', 22, 8.115, 26, '/iwm20Op1ytjFfY89pqqPUEJYxhw.jpg', None)"}
