{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:41.086995+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 157.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b2dd1725f55043a182ec9afcd95c7b79', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1089712, 1, \"Summer Lovin'\", 'Haley gets back together with Dylan. Alex and Sanjay plan their breakup since they are both going off to college. Mitchell avoids finding a new job and takes up art. Jay and Gloria try to find a good preschool for Joe.', '2015-09-23', 22, 7.741, 27, '/fJXdKR4ACaIQ7GLPJITL2e52VrF.jpg', None, '250337776eb84f878d6dcbfa0334d3c8', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1099080, 2, 'The Day Alex Left for College', \"Phil and Claire are hurt when Alex lies about her college move-in date and Luke doesn't want to spend the day at Phil's open house; being landlords stresses out Mitch and Cam.\", '2015-09-30', 22, 7.364, 22, '/uS0iG7ZtJvlsT354SWKYmlAuePO.jpg', None, '6cec663bacab44b5b8213af778f207a1', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1112164, 3, 'The Closet Case', \"Mitchell takes a job with a rival of Jay's; Luke and Manny visit Alex but use the opportunity to meet girls; Gloria is upset when a cheerleader doesn't decorate Manny's locker; Phil and Claire try to play chicken when Dylan moves in.\", '2015-10-07', 22, 7.542, 24, '/aB4Nt0BuhsIJnygyxwvjOOxXkYF.jpg', None, '54e074b871a843459bc38ff88417b884', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1112165, 4, 'She Crazy', 'Phil convinces Lily to help with hatch the ducks he made a habitat for; Claire wants to impress her father with some ideas she has for the business; Cam spends time bonding with the frat guys.', '2015-10-14', 22, 7.25, 20, '/dnAvxI3PdP9vZ88a69Y8DIv6Qo2.jpg', None, '72a25c71795c4afe8e0271b3150c422f', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/amOKwUXek7WC6GaIEHqL3u84FKH.jpg', None, '7eedd0d0b5d049ec8f8b62da8b962246', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1182845, 19, \"Man Shouldn't Lie\", \"Claire brings home a stray dog and gets the kids to help her hide it from Phil while she tries to find its owner. Unfortunately, her evasive behavior ... (190 characters truncated) ... when the husband turns out to be a real guy's guy, Jay might be eating crow. And Cameron rents out their upstairs apartment to a Christian rock band.\", '2016-04-13', 22, 7.316, 19, '/ugntq6E4cfr7nZDlVOd2XwjUgkQ.jpg', None, 'c5c8ad8860bd4b589f1354c23143e4e9', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1190283, 20, 'Promposal', 'With Closet-Con right around the corner, Claire is on high alert and convinced there is a mole in the company. Meanwhile, Phil goes vigilante when he ... (156 characters truncated) ... helps Luke with his \"promposal\" while Cam helps with Manny\\'s, but Cam goes a little overboard, revealing that there maybe something deeper going on.', '2016-05-04', 22, 7.026, 19, '/3birTUtqCbNDxvpIy6o7b5bztsy.jpg', None, '54fa6fedbbaa4e9e9da9567530ff8c36', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1190848, 21, 'Crazy Train', 'Dede is getting remarried, and Manny convinces the family to take the train up to the wedding. Jay could not be more ecstatic that Dede has moved on  ... (168 characters truncated) ... is also on the train. Luke and Manny go a little girl crazy; Gloria gets stuck in coach; and Alex gets caught up in the romance of the train herself.', '2016-05-11', 22, 7.421, 19, '/x40wQYeWqXIX2CdaQNCvhELh3Sa.jpg', None, 'f7a5f81f01354e9bb0f2b7bf4927942b', '7e5a350645e2475b968aa730a95d95fa', 1190849, 22, 'Double Click', \"Claire can't seem to find the right time to fire one of her employees, while, back at home, Phil thinks he caught Luke with a girl in his bed, and no ... (120 characters truncated) ... ter the workforce than he thought, and Cameron and Mitch butt heads on how to share time with Lily now that Cameron took a summer job in Kansas City.\", '2016-05-18', 22, 7.706, 17, '/4nxyxFpBw9BrBFg5yblFziOl6G6.jpg', None)"}
