{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:41.419554+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 157.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bea200a4a5184bd1abde23bbe03de91a', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1353981, 1, 'Lake Life', \"Jay forces the family to take their family vacation on a houseboat on a lake in an effort to create memories that will last long after he's gone. Mea ... (89 characters truncated) ... f the sun at all costs; Phil and Claire try out some adventureous excursions; and the kids' quest for a good time may not be as fun as they expected.\", '2017-09-27', 22, 7.125, 24, '/yPu72VI5djOJasQqJ3H9hi2t7Q0.jpg', None, 'f173e43c580a4972bd225963278bc93e', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1368202, 2, 'The Long Goodbye', 'Phil and Claire realize that Alex may be more self-sufficient in college than they give her credit for when they drop in for a quick visit. Meanwhile ... (134 characters truncated) ... identally accelerated a planned renovation, and Hayley gets an unexpected opportunity when she befriends a wealthy female member at the country club.', '2017-10-04', 22, 6.263, 19, '/hXeDNUXWeLWiGVR295OolsOAgFR.jpg', None, '35b8cb4664f44c5db91d79a378d8aa57', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1374415, 3, 'Catch of the Day', \"Phil's convinced he is going to have a day of bad luck after failing to successfully complete his daily superstition. However, Claire is eager to mak ... (67 characters truncated) ... Mitch is certain that Cam is undermining him during their kitchen renovation, and Jay is determined to get Gloria to admit she was in a car accident.\", '2017-10-11', 22, 6.813, 16, '/z0KpcUWeppv8WOXPZAvpO6EzzHN.jpg', None, '6e14a488b7634ae08548955f8ca0f7f3', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1376033, 4, 'Sex, Lies & Kickball', \"Jay's best friend, Shorty, is back from Costa Rica and stays at the house so they can catch up and reconnect. However, Shorty is spending more time w ... (44 characters truncated) ... nwhile, Alex is ready to shed her good-girl image and is going to prove to Claire that her relationship with Ben is definitely a sexual relationship.\", '2017-10-18', 22, 6.533, 15, '/hoVlMgFUY0sSH2BJgei2iavehKw.jpg', None, '428990173017453fb5f09b545c85f972', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/adjnnMRuvf0J2bTqMz75U2KAChj.jpg', None, '491e422e79df4ede8e4c4bf035ed74be', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1461074, 19, 'CHiPs and Salsa', \"When Haley hears that her loopy boss is looking for a product with the magical properties of peppers, she tries to gain favor by convincing Gloria to sell her salsa to NERP; Mitchell gets Cam the police ride-along he's always dreamed of.\", '2018-04-11', 22, 6.75, 16, '/oxVi7rZaAvxDCgt6z2X37V5BEvE.jpg', None, '04cb53de8acb4d7aa1ad4df8ca8785f2', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1470105, 20, 'Mother!', \"When Dede drops in unexpectedly, Mitchell and Cam come to a realization about her effect on their lives; Phil, Luke, Alex and Haley all have different bad news to break to Claire and compete about when to do it, the tiny window of time after her monthly spa day when she's her most relaxed.\", '2018-05-02', 22, 7.125, 16, '/vq4uT5zIA0Tu9UvI4yTXRxtPcA6.jpg', None, 'f4a7a72babff418da72acae56230bdc7', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1477099, 21, 'The Escape', \"Haley meets Arvin's parents but when things don't go as planned, fate leads to an unexpected reunion with all of her ex-boyfriends. Meanwhile, the fa ... (77 characters truncated) ... old scores. But as Jay, Claire and Mitchell compete for her time, Phil, Cam and Gloria end up getting trapped in the home's basement with no way out.\", '2018-05-09', 22, 6.947, 19, '/cQASPYqzWwmgNQqmLGlWuoE4CnN.jpg', None, '011dc50501dc43cebe0561adc673c7d7', 'c05cdfb1e8654ab4ab5e106e36f9b8e9', 1484669, 22, 'Clash of Swords', \"Mitchell sneaks out to “Hero-Con” with fanboy Phil, dressed as their favorite characters from the show “Clash of Swords.” It's great until Phil commi ... (51 characters truncated) ...  kind, Gloria's dinosaur party for Joe is ruined when her nemesis, Dr. Donna Duncan, upstages her with a far bigger and better party right next door.\", '2018-05-16', 22, 6.667, 18, '/boSjqc58n8TIqqiKtbmZv23lPdK.jpg', None)"}
