{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:41.591472+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 687 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:41.591570+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 158s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('aef5b87ac3d840e093789b04455916cf', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1559118, 1, 'I Love a Parade', \"The Pritchett-Dunphy-Tucker clan are going to be setting off more than a few fireworks when they get together at the annual Fourth of July parade whe ... (27 characters truncated) ... e grand marshal. Haley's goodbye with Arvin before his trip to Switzerland doesn't go as planned when she's distracted by the return of an old flame.\", '2018-09-26', 22, 6.84, 25, '/ojJ5KFcXntaVplzH4J2d32041iW.jpg', None, '934738f98eca4c5092886dd72c60236c', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1575824, 2, 'Kiss and Tell', \"Haley needs a little help deciding whether or not to tell Arvin about her kiss with Dylan and goes to Mitch and Cam for their advice. Gloria suspects Manny's Canadian girlfriend is made up and wants to find out the real truth.\", '2018-10-03', 22, 7.4, 20, '/wK7Yklk1BBlR9A77JXFd0Gp7s8o.jpg', None, '5566126a520c44d5b5702a97216625bf', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1582177, 3, 'A Sketchy Area', \"Phil stumbles into an exciting new career after dropping by Luke's college. Claire deals with her dad, and the merger of Pritchett's Closets with a t ... (11 characters truncated) ... hipper company. Mitch's new high-profile case as an assistant district attorney is marred by an unflattering courtroom sketch by the resident artist.\", '2018-10-10', 22, 6.579, 19, '/p8W7fVhtHwYgU5RHAd00mGDcR4Z.jpg', None, 'e8c46cf30d9d49e4bdcba47200e0bbf3', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1590522, 4, 'Torn Between Two Lovers', \"Haley can't seem to choose between her past and present relationships and is forced to make a decision. Manny returns to college and dorm life while his girlfriend continues to stay at Jay and Gloria's—and might be overstaying her welcome.\", '2018-10-17', 22, 7.222, 18, '/hmXN1Drb5BdnM1FFzWG3TrL2ZHR.jpg', None, '388d8dbee30a4117b814cf01a9699aee', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/6Nkd3umDQVKZf7QXoxvan4mh3WI.jpg', None, '1c6ed1f78b874a909dd4c357c66eb0f8', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1737357, 19, 'Yes-Woman', \"In an effort to be less negative, Claire is rebranding herself as the girl who says “yes” and inadvertently approves of Luke's new relationship with someone from his work. Meanwhile, Phil tries to surprise Alex at school right before she receives an award she didn't tell him about.\", '2019-04-03', 22, 7.813, 16, '/oa0ShkCrunPHWP4uR8GDsDyW6VT.jpg', None, '04602c84fbfa43e0b889e65c8ae51de2', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1747910, 20, \"Can't Elope\", \"Haley and Dylan's plan to quietly elope before the babies are born doesn't go as smoothly as they had hoped. Meanwhile, Jay continues to try and get his new business off the ground by courting an Instagram celebrity.\", '2019-04-10', 22, 7.267, 15, '/yylm8tNBws7mbhFnrn3kCOSI6To.jpg', None, '86fde76f45044a98986cc4307c84810c', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1768591, 21, 'Commencement', 'Cam is finally getting a chance to shine when he is asked to preside over the high school graduation ceremony at the last minute, while Jay gives the commencement address. Meanwhile, Claire runs into her former high school rival who brings out the worst in her.', '2019-05-01', 22, 7.133, 15, '/v4XEdxWVHV1ryFhvzbwQ2OWjpr3.jpg', None, '3e88c22034174ce1889f50af3f806f02', 'df00e6193ff640c89f3f36c9376df194', 1768593, 22, 'A Year of Birthdays', \"As the birth of Haley and Dylan's twins approaches, we take a look back at how each family member celebrated their birthdays this past year.\", '2019-05-08', 22, 7.857, 14, '/vwZpeW2y1kAuQYF0Z4ovEJX1iZS.jpg', None)"}
