{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:41.752919+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 158.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f4be96284b8443938aa154f1a7ac0517', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 1841795, 1, 'New Kids on the Block', 'Haley is determined to follow the advice in her parenting books with the twins, but Phil and Claire think their old methods are better. Meanwhile, Manny is set to direct Jay’s dog bed commercial in the hopes of winning his ex-girlfriend back.', '2019-09-25', 22, 7.353, 17, '/c32YHCCcXOxKy7HfT4jS1XjVm7n.jpg', None, '58e130509fc94aceb00c29e104d3e578', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 1936371, 2, 'Snapped', \"Claire needs to get everyone out of the house before they make her look bad in front of a reporter from an important women's business magazine. Meanwhile, Jay invites Manny to a little wine tasting in an attempt to spend some quality time together.\", '2019-10-02', 22, 7.143, 14, '/LQS6nxqyLBOvpA4jCewMKGHD0G.jpg', None, 'c524086f40104a7499e719a6cff9d999', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 1938957, 3, 'Perfect Pairs', 'Phil, Claire, Alex and Luke love having the twins around, but taking care of them is exhausting! However, when they realize the babies might help them with a few things on their to-do lists, they offer to give Haley the day off.', '2019-10-09', 22, 7.267, 15, '/pVKAY71ZvzTinNXlgTnGDh739uy.jpg', None, 'e55d5d680a934ed793b54ee626bb8196', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 1944777, 4, 'Pool Party', \"Mitch and Cam help Lily overcome her insecurities about wearing a bathing suit to a pool party but discover their own. Meanwhile, now that Gloria's new internship is taking up so much of her time, Jay is feeling particularly neglected.\", '2019-10-16', 22, 7.429, 14, '/a16vPZ833THpiJMDGg16d0VvjDo.jpg', None, '47502bbb18304fad942932a644160bd1', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70' ... 116 parameters truncated ... '/sz8Y4yFzLdtcKt422OvmH5RRQMC.jpg', None, '08c61d01b32442a6b8e5f24ccf123f38', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 2181897, 15, 'Baby Steps', \"Claire has landed an interview for her dream job and is thwarted on her way to the interview by Phil's tricky staircase. Meanwhile, Cam and Mitch debate the pros and cons of adopting another baby after unexpectedly receiving a call from their adoption agency.\", '2020-03-18', 22, 7.25, 16, '/gTdNm2ehYYeQ96G0Aixoy2Kr0j5.jpg', None, '2c4ad215f3504a7a846556eb461d22fa', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 2200640, 16, \"I'm Going to Miss This\", \"Mitchell is having a hard time letting go of his old life and Gloria steps in to help him say goodbye. Meanwhile, Haley, Luke and Alex decide to throw a party at the Dunphy house when Claire and Phil leave for a trip, and Dylan's mom takes the twins for the night.\", '2020-04-01', 22, 7.375, 16, '/e2R5Av8KKG7I0O1KufwZUFugmCF.jpg', None, '45e17d70682242ec8ab8858cb9c325dd', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 2200641, 17, 'Finale (1)', \"Mitchell and Cam settle in on their new normal, and Phil and Claire decide that one of the kids needs to move out in order to take control of the house again. Meanwhile, as Gloria becomes more successful at work, she notices Jay, Manny and Joe don't seem to need her as much.\", '2020-04-08', 22, 7.625, 16, '/sjt3EFrmAuT9UfdOmCKBcw7xvA4.jpg', None, 'c6ef1fd6cf4c4ee5988747d6dd929d4b', 'e5eccb9edafc4b6c95deca0a52368b70', 2200642, 18, 'Finale (2)', 'The entire family discovers saying goodbye is much harder than it seems.', '2020-04-08', 22, 7.941, 17, '/7ceJ4Qj0tev5zFHjFsout23p8dN.jpg', None)"}
