{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.111391+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 159.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('21414268e7184c249ad0828b325a994c', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526899, 8, 'Extra Perks: Owner Overboard', None, '2014-02-10', 20, 0.0, 0, None, None, '261700af18f54476a37611ea85a011bd', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526900, 9, \"5 Star Secrets: Miami's Fontainebleau Hotel\", 'Anthony stays at the Sorento Penthouse at the Fontainebleau Hotel in South Beach, FL, tours the kitchen, and has lunch on the beach of the five-star hotel.', '2014-12-02', 21, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7e0b4b08cbeb496a9181d961d249d953', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526901, 10, \"5 Star Secrets: Chicago's Langham Hotel\", 'Anthony books the regent suite at the Langham Hotel in Chicago to show the audience what a five-star hotel is like.', '2014-12-02', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '085201e438364ae0a90254478a16dada', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526869, 11, 'Top Ten Blowups and Meltdowns', \"Anthony reveals the 10 moments that shocked, appalled and dumbfounded him. With anecdotes and never-before-seen footage, Anthony proves that while he thinks he's seen it all, struggling hotel owners are always full of surprises.\", '2015-01-20', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '4b3726273ffb413aa4f1a99cedc07d8b', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63' ... 248 parameters truncated ... None, None, '33ae4486a9564cb8bc8a638e0aab1561', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526921, 37, '5 Star CA: Good Dog Day Afternoon', 'Anthony visits the beachfront, pet-friendly Hotel del Coronado in Southern California.', '2016-12-27', 21, 0.0, 0, None, None, '58b4a4beb4064e2095d9b24326a027f2', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526922, 38, '5 Stars NY: Palace of Spirits', 'Anthony is at the Palace Hotel in N.Y., tasting a 100-year-old whiskey.', '2016-12-27', 21, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7d13fc79ae6c41f58df920c1fea13aaf', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526923, 39, '5 Star CT: What You Get for the Honey', 'Winvian Farm, an idyllic countryside inn in Connecticut features a luxurious spa and a farm-to-table restaurant.', '2016-12-27', 21, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c4636abf5c404ad1a83437275c2fdaa7', 'd37eb0131508488e984040f6a60b7b63', 3526924, 40, '5 Star Hi: Wowie Maui', 'The stunning Four Seasons in Maui, Hawaii, one of the standard-bearers in guest service; a lesson in handcrafting ice cubes; an award-winning Kona coffee farm.', '2016-12-27', 21, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
