{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.255514+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 159.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('616d9d56ea904f59a4954f053ad38e3a', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915774, 1, \"Gurney's Inn: Montauk, NY\", 'Hospitality expert Anthony Melchiorri attempts to turn struggling hotels into tourist hot spots. In this premiere episode, the host revamps an outdated family-run resort in Montauk, N.Y.', '2012-04-09', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b5b80149f9604360ba23085d2cc993a5', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915780, 2, 'Penguin Hotel: South Beach, FL', 'The host visits a boutique hotel in Miami’s South Beach that’s struggling to find an identity among the hip, trendy competition.', '2012-04-16', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a4ed3794b2c94004a7755916181c94d6', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915781, 3, 'New Yorker Boutique Hotel: Miami, FL', 'Anthony helps the owners of the New Yorker Boutique Hotel in Miami, who are struggling to stay afloat after sinking their life savings into the property.', '2012-04-23', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a73d1eebf1a949cfbd447304b35d77fc', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915777, 4, 'Purple Orchid Inn Resort and Spa: Livermore, CA', 'The host helps expectant parents turn around their struggling resort and spa in Livermore, Cal.', '2012-04-30', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '63fb769a9e754402861dfe6d37ec9aca', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, '559b808f40204eeb888845b7920630d8', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915772, 10, 'Newport Inn: Newport, RI', 'Anthony takes on a hotel whose clueless owner is more interested in buying up-to-date gym equipment then keeping his hotel in shape and his pool filled with water.', '2012-06-25', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f9a05d6b8c634cdfa4c584e6bfdb3aa6', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915773, 11, 'Dude Rancher Lodge: Billings, MT', 'In downtown Billings, MT, the Dude Rancher Lodge has a one-star rating, no business, and a decor that alternates between historical and present-day.', '2012-07-09', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'de3afb0eab484235baf8147381bb5675', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915779, 12, 'The Vermont Inn: Mendon, VT', 'The 16-room Vermont Inn, run by the owners’ brother-in-law, can’t fill their rooms or their restaurant. Anthony will have to make some tough decisions to save it.', '2012-07-23', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '971bf7e5e8bf430aa0c045e0fef96dd3', '38a5341ed0c3461d86a4de9c6f1edeb9', 915776, 13, 'Dream Inn: Daytona Beach, FL', 'In Daytona Beach, Anthony tries to bring the Dream Inn out of bankruptcy, but discovers that the general manager has nothing to do because his domineering mother makes all the decisions.', '2012-08-06', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
