{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.446859+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 159.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('688a11c2de08448fae6c789b0aedeae5', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915785, 1, 'Caribe Playa Beach Resort: Puerto Rico', \"Anthony is called to a beachfront resort in Puerto Rico, and soon discovers that the problems are due to the fact that the general manager isn't doing her job... and she's married to the owner.\", '2012-12-03', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '42326beed40a466d99935a0e25283781', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915790, 2, 'Triangle T Ranch: Dragoon, AZ', \"Anthony needs to turn around the historic Triangle T Ranch in Arizona. The owner doesn't know what she's doing and the grounds are a mess, but Anthony vows to get it into shape.\", '2012-12-10', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e3524f549a314374bfeb663c69e7eb5d', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915789, 3, 'Maui Sunseeker Resort: Maui, HI', 'Anthony heads to Maui to help out a gay/lesbian resort that is losing money hand over fist. To pull it off, he has to convince the GM to stand up to the owner.', '2012-12-17', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'bd301ca58b9e4000911467b9603e0571', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915788, 4, 'The Hotel Leger: Mokelumne Hill, CA', 'Anthony is heading for the Hotel Leger in Calaveras County, CA, near the Sierra Nevada Mountains in Mokelumne Hill. The hotel has thirteen unique gue ... (55 characters truncated) ... y Canty purchased the hotel in 2004 and is trying to return it to its former glory as one of the oldest hotels in the area and the heart of the town.', '2013-01-07', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '6f71a83ad6604abb8b86d1f24fb2d04c', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'df0c3082ede84c38822f3581f33813be', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915791, 10, 'Gardenia Resort: Negril, Jamaica', \"Anthony travels to the 75-room Gardenia Resort in Jamaica and finds himself up against dirty rooms and a general manager who isn't aggressive enough to get the job done.\", '2013-03-04', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c7fd53a86bd04cb8b994a6a7413873a4', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915784, 11, 'Alpenhof Lodge: Mammoth Lakes, CA', 'Anthony visits a picture-perfect ski lodge that he soon realizes has family management issues.', '2013-03-11', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'dab1693a18d742f5b32b3cf111b2689a', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915792, 12, 'Bromley Sun Lodge: Peru, VT', 'Anthony is called in to help the Bromley Sun Lodge, which suffers from poor maintenance and owners who are in over their heads after a fire almost destroyed the hotel.', '2013-03-18', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e7cc1bb80f924b7bad6beeed633bb099', '7432620a9dab47ae9469481d63273a7f', 915787, 13, 'Western Riviera: Grand Lake, CO', 'Anthony travels to the Western Riviera in Grand Lake, CO, to help a couple with no hotel experience, with a staff that have no hotel experience, in a town where the business dies down every winter.', '2013-03-25', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
