{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.595439+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('c05d7d2d12014b728116b6a45125dc1c', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 915797, 1, 'Crack Vials and Denials: Baltimore, MD', \"Anthony visits the Abacrombie Inn, once an award-winning bed and breakfast in historic Baltimore. Unfortunately, the inn has been run down by its new owners. Can Anthony save a hotel that’s rife with spoiled food, crack vials and more dust than he's ever seen?\", '2013-08-12', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a99b7e3b96304d3d85e3a34c23154b24', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 915798, 2, 'Greece Lightning: Litochoro, Greece', 'Anthony heads to Mount Olympus in Greece to help the struggling and mold-infested Litohoro Olympus Resort Villas and Spa. Can he break through the cultural barrier to the resorts’ misguided owners to refurbish this once great Greek resort?', '2013-08-19', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8b50c3e0222145209cde8882c6f46bfc', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 915799, 3, 'Fire Drill Flame Out: Douglas, AZ', 'Anthony hops on a plane and heads to the small town of Douglas -- located just a couple hours outside of Tucson, AZ -- in an attempt to revamp the struggling, but historic Hotel Gadsden.', '2013-08-26', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9cecd1461b8347dc8a0a3361d9dbe529', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 915800, 4, 'Tropical Termites: Guanacaste, Costa Rica', 'Anthony travels to the Hotel Iguanazul in Costa Rica on the beautiful beach of the Pacific Ocean. Can Anthony handle a drunken owner, a litter-filled resort and thousands of termites before the property crumbles away?', '2013-09-02', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '4c6fdfb23626459e819c22db9074dff5', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'e02c2bd37f414f48a3576fdcb1cce4f3', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 967893, 10, 'Niagara Falls Down: Niagara Falls, Canada', 'Anthony goes to the Canadian side of Niagara Falls, where the not-so-ritzy Ritz Inn is struggling to stay afloat. With a stubborn owner, filthy rooms and a wedding chapel that doubles as a storage room, can Anthony save the inn before it sinks completely?', '2013-10-14', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7abc3c5b285c4c2889d5ed166bb4dbd3', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 967894, 11, 'Operation Sandy Part 1: Seaside Heights, NJ', 'Anthony gets himself into a storm of a situation when he arrives at the Thunderbird Motel in Seaside Heights, NJ, and tries to repair a motel that’s still hurting 9 months after being hit by Hurricane Sandy.', '2013-10-21', 43, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c687824a6624437c9dde4db813aefa7b', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 968149, 12, 'Operation Sandy Part 2: Seaside Heights, NJ', 'In the second hour of a special 2-part episode, Anthony continues his mission to help out the Jersey Shore with a visit to Seaside Heights, one of the places that was ravaged by Hurricane Sandy 9 months ago.', '2013-10-28', 43, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a1148bd891b249a0ad00c93da721c8c9', '4d5567a21ac54edaa12feef40bcdd5f5', 967896, 13, 'Crap Out: Sparks, NV', 'Anthony heads to Sparks, NV, to help save the 92-room Victorian Inn. The owner, Marilyn Fink, has owned and operated the hotel since 2003, but economic downturns caused revenue to drastically decline. Can Anthony help Marilyn save the Victorian Inn before it goes under for good?', '2013-11-04', 43, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
