{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.745510+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e7684e8539d94a99b68fa78bb7671a12', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087045, 1, 'Alaskan Heavyweights: Juneau, AK', 'Anthony Melchiorri heads to Juneau, AK, to help a 100-yr-old hotel and bar. With a belligerent bar manager, feuding family owners, no security, a trespassing bear and a crushed designer, can he help keep this historic icon afloat?', '2014-01-27', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '94ec596fa3734f59b69f388147ed1a50', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087046, 2, 'Owner Overboard: Islamorada, FL', \"Anthony's in the Florida Keys, fishing capital of the world, but the waterfront Creekside Inn is sinking. After the owner/GM mistreats an undercover guest, Anthony tries to set them on course to fix the horrible customer service.\", '2014-02-03', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '75bdf270b1e443a0a450b28eb3118f90', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087047, 3, 'Mis-Fortune Hotel: Las Vegas, NV', 'Anthony heads to ever-popular Las Vegas to repair the issues plaguing the Fortune Hotel. With a leaky ceiling and an owner who speaks no English, can Anthony bring good fortune back to this fractured business?', '2014-02-10', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '17960d6cb0b9406e99c8fa0f40c4c8fc', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087049, 4, 'Breaking Point: Saint John, New Brunswick', 'Anthony heads to Saint John, New Brunswick, Canada helping the historic Chipman Hill Suites. Things explode when an overly tyrannical owner threatens a housekeeper, who quits, pushing the overworked staff to its breaking point', '2014-02-17', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd69b3ea80b614e538fda75eb612eac77', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, '8e3db8839ae84e53809b9599748e53bb', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087055, 10, 'Swamped: Roaring Gap, NC', \"Anthony is in North Carolina to help the Peros family keep the High Meadows Inn & Nikola's Restaurant alive. The co-owner/father is a hopeless optimist, but Anthony gives him a needed reality check before he costs them everything.\", '2014-05-19', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'edf235b052334cefabcc2c7f525aa3f9', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087056, 11, 'Rat Race: Atlanta, GA', 'Anthony is down south in Atlanta, Georgia to help the University Inn at Emory. Despite being ideally situated the hotel is hounded by bad reviews, outdated rooms and a possible rat problem thanks to a dilapidated exterior.', '2014-05-26', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '4fbc52a929194b3192d34efd06a6fef2', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087057, 12, 'Stormy Wedding: Hood River, OR', 'Anthony is in beautiful Hood River, OR to help the Vagabond Lodge. Anthony transforms this picturesque property into a profitable event space, but can they pull off a wedding in just 48 hours, despite the looming storm clouds?', '2014-06-02', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b5ebe7150d1045d2ac7d1db17c772247', 'd67e4dbce3434ca1a37f549fe531dc13', 1087058, 13, 'Airing the Family Business: Glenwood Springs, CO', \"Voted 'Most Fun Town in America' by USA Today, Anthony is in Glenwood Springs, CO to help the stubborn owner of the 45-room Glenwood Motor Inn leave the laundry room behind, to get her into the office to properly manage the hotel.\", '2014-06-09', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
