{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:43.890037+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('dc8c6c10d2814f63b9f5cc060eee5ad0', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087059, 1, 'Crash Course in Daytona: Daytona Beach, FL', 'Anthony is in Daytona Beach, FL, to save the historic 50-room Streamline Hotel. Can he leverage its NASCAR connection, steer the owner in a new direction and derail an inexperienced, hothead GM before the hotel crashes and burns?', '2014-10-07', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f7e6796269f8474a857d90f4aaa75756', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087060, 2, 'Swinging for the Fences: State College, PA', \"Anthony is in crisis mode when he finds out the 85-room Autoport Motel in State College, PA is in foreclosure. With the hotel's swinging reputation and lack of management, can he convince the bank the Autoport is worth saving?\", '2014-10-14', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '05d26d93a2a64674b9c871416aa1cd77', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087061, 3, 'Rotting Woodstock: Woodstock, NY', \"Anthony visits the cool and historic Woodstock, NY to get the struggling 35-room Woodstock Lodge back on its feet. But the owner's stubbornness and anger could force Anthony to leave before they can render any help at all.\", '2014-10-21', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '021c84877da144ec91e6dd61b87245ae', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087062, 4, 'Crappy Management: Crookston, MN', 'Anthony is in Crookston, MN to help the struggling 73-room Crookston Inn & Convention Center. Frustrations mount when Anthony forces a surly manager to own up to a disgusting bathroom, and suggests the owners fire another.', '2014-10-28', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8af17f51a01e423eb246a3b49c669119', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee' ... 44 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'da55d3e400cd49ff811e51db0d596e94', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087069, 9, 'Clearing the Heir: Moclips, WA', 'Anthony Melchiorri heads to Moclips, WA, to help the family-run Ocean Crest Resort. With guest rooms reminiscent of a 70s sitcom and an heir who seems completely clueless, Anthony needs to prepare the next generation.', '2014-12-16', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '43f2de663704411384d7712e13a62fef', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087070, 10, 'Sleeping on the Job: San Francisco, CA', \"Anthony is dogging the owner of the CitiGarden Hotel in San Francisco, but with disgusting guest rooms, an under-performing GM & a sexy surprise, he'll need to overcome a lot of negative reviews to create a new brand of success.\", '2014-12-30', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'bc6b9717c0f849d1b4270cdf79cf3fd0', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087071, 11, 'Getting Screwed: Williston, ND', \"When Anthony hits the booming oil town of Williston, ND, and sees the Missouri Flats Inn isn't treating its guests well, he decides to do something he's never done before.\", '2015-01-06', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '54b6136d326e478e83f51f682cfcdc2e', '356d2ba5df1a462cb93e605b47ccc0ee', 1087072, 12, 'The Big Sleasy: New Orleans, LA', 'Anthony visits a boutique hotel in historic and tourist heavy New Orleans, and finds mistreated employees and ridiculous cost-cutting policies. Can Anthony urge a stubborn owner to sell the hotel to her sons for a fresh start?', '2015-01-13', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
