{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:44.035009+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('30ba914014b24d51b718c926c621bd4f', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 1105166, 1, 'Fix Your Kicks on Route 66: Route 66, AZ', 'In the Season 6 premiere, host Anthony Melchiorri challenges himself and his team when they hit the road in a tricked-out RV to help three struggling ... (66 characters truncated) ...  offered to the owners of a once-thriving \"luxury\" inn, a former bordello on the National Registry of Historic Places and a camping and trailer park.', '2015-09-01', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '840dd3332f6b462cb35661662b30bcf7', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 1105167, 2, 'Bite Me: Nashua, NH', \"Bed bugs need to be exterminated from the 40-room Country Barn Motel in Nashua, N.H., where Anthony encounters three owners who argue and aren't receptive to change.\", '2015-09-08', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c34521570d4142e4a6336b3e324dd8ad', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3144845, 3, 'Not ANice Hotel: Orlando, FL', 'Anthony visits Orlando, FL, where he discovers that the 350-room ANice Inn & Suites is anything but nice. After finding killer bees, bedbugs, mold & feral cats, can Anthony force an owner to invest in fixing all the issues?', '2015-09-15', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '74d722e650e242e38739cc288da21c3a', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3144846, 4, 'To Be or Not To Be: Cedar City, UT', \"Anthony travels to Cedar City, UT, to help the owners of the Stratford Court Hotel. Upon arrival, he discovers that they are already busy renovating the lobby... but haven't closed the hotel.\", '2015-09-22', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3d9845cc74c24827b4faad0da6c71dc6', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, '3723206fa4c64921bcad615c96cb5702', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3145690, 10, 'Spinning Out of Control: Galena, IL', \"Anthony is called in to help the Grant Hills Motel in Galena, IL. However, he soon discovers that the motel's main issue isn't the poorly maintained rooms but the feuding sisters who run the place.\", '2015-11-03', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ade026a6c1f347e59e355006cf00eb49', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3145692, 11, 'A Tall Odor in Myrtle Beach: Myrtle Beach, SC', 'Anthony deals with the Lancer Motel, a 59-room blight in Myrtle Beach, South Carolina, which suffers from disorganized management, bedbugs, and a staff that are paid far below minimum wage.', '2015-11-10', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ebada12dc66c49a69ff76be0e12f814b', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3145693, 12, 'Underwear, Under Where?: Gatlinburg, TN', \"At the 120-room Brookside Resort in Gatlinburg, TN, Anthony has to deal with a manager who doesn't like to confront guests, overworked housekeepers, and filthy rooms.\", '2015-11-17', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9c20d7928cd740828b71c2daa0fdbea4', '43db451a16924edbae97661d24795235', 3145694, 13, 'Ex Marks the Spot: Bangor, ME', 'Anthony travels to Bangor, Maine, to help out the Charles Inn. Not only is the hotel losing money, but it has a noisy bar attached to the lobby and the manager insists that he owns 50% of the bar.', '2015-11-24', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
