{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:44.178810+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ea59b24612654935b75ac0ffcfc872aa', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 1187168, 1, 'Hostel Takeover: El Paso, TX', 'In the Season 7 premiere, Anthony deals with ugly grime and safety issues at a former Texas hotel, which is now being run as a hostel.', '2016-04-18', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '38864cf2f91a4352a5f0ebf5839a55fa', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526873, 2, 'Futility Closet: Misquamicut, RI', 'Anthony battles a bully owner and a utility closet overrun with mold in Rhode Island.', '2016-04-25', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd154c52f67ba43179fcd7530c9d91115', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526874, 3, 'Blind Faith: Winter Haven, FL', 'Anthony tries to help a visually impaired owner see the path to success in Florida.', '2016-05-02', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '161ec02a8cb7465db25b0c0e412eb8a0', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526875, 4, 'Rocky Relationships: Libby, MT', \"Anthony helps two motels in Libby, MT: The Sandman and the Evergreen. A couple owns the first motel and their son owns the second. The Evergreen is going under and if Anthony doesn't resolve the personal issues between the family members, there may be no saving the motel.\", '2016-05-09', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fb5fc0f8360d4b5d8558067ff44935f6', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130' ... 44 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'f775c112cefc45acb69bad20f69587ba', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526880, 9, 'Going Poconowhere: Towanda, PA', 'Anthony Melchiorri must give the owner a wake-up call in order to save The Bradford Inn in Towanda, PA.', '2016-06-20', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '6d7f79cd240841ccac79059da43c7e3b', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526881, 10, 'Tiny Horse, Big Problems: Cody, WY', \"Anthony visits the Big Bear Motel in Cody, Wyoming, where the owners' daughter is eager to take over, but she has a lot to learn about running the family business.\", '2016-06-27', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5d65eca7377e4debbed55ca23bce848d', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526882, 11, 'Funeral Home Impossible: San Juan Bautista, CA', 'Anthony must convince an owner to pass her California hotel on to her kids.', '2016-07-11', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f405309b329b4adabcaf52c292b3ae47', 'fb0d95e02ef24bed84d12d6d82c44130', 3526883, 12, 'Anchorless in Anchorage: Anchorage, AK', 'Anthony Melchiorri must convince a hotel owner in Alaska to change his poor management style.', '2016-07-18', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
