{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:44.330221+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 160.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('7d7599a9a8ac48fe805f2590859a32e2', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 1239634, 1, 'Full Throttle in Sturgis: Sturgis, SD', 'Anthony is on a mission to save three struggling hotels near Sturgis, S.D., challenging himself to fix all the issues at these properties before hundreds of thousands of bikers come rolling into town.', '2016-10-24', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8fa5cc5c95fa48bbbd33a60143c7d9db', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526884, 2, 'Fire Island Meltdown: Fire Island, NY', \"At Clegg's Hotel on Fire Island, New York, Anthony meets a controlling owner that needs to update his hotel, which has barely changed in 70 years. Will Anthony be able to get through to the owner?\", '2016-10-31', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8a7bf604d4d043b2b6d8ec900bd572c0', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526885, 3, 'Lions, Tigers and Wasps, Oh My!: Eureka Springs, AR', 'Anthony visits Turpentine Creek Wildlife Refuge in Arkansas where lodging takes a backseat to the animals. If Anthony can help the owners make lodging a priority, they could generate more money to save more animals.', '2016-11-07', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0b1b19e236204ec5b46d1aa841aea9f6', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 1239635, 4, 'Alarmed in Alaska: Soldotna, AK', \"At Hooligan's Lodge in Soldotna, Alaska, Anthony meets an owner who won't comply with the local fire code. She doesn't pay her employees on time, and when she does, the checks bounce. Can Anthony give her a wake-up call before the place goes up in flames?\", '2016-11-14', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e4b0a8d67fa54e129ba4727d2a37e6d4', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, '00cc3099e3c742b5ba139530f2bb411d', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526890, 10, 'Desert Disaster: Palm Springs, CA', 'Anthony visits Palm Springs, California to help the Cambridge Inn. The inexperienced owner is running out of capital after just a few months, and her general managers are clashing and making bad security decisions with guests.', '2017-10-16', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '27ed66f08bdf4a44b076b799d19ad8f7', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526891, 11, 'Chaos on the Cape: Cape Cod, MA', \"Anthony Melchiorri visits a motel in a beach town on Cape Cod where the employees are passionate about the property but the uninterested owner is loo ... (32 characters truncated) ... he motel's general and assistant managers, Anthony works to convince the owner to take down the ominious For Sale sign and re-invest in his property.\", '2017-10-30', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7dc56a7761f0405c9bc257c8724379e6', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526893, 12, 'West Coast Wipe Out: San Clemente, CA', \"Anthony Melchiorri visits a San Clemente, CA, hotel where the family of the deceased owner struggles to run the business in her honor. Upon arrival,  ... (164 characters truncated) ... When the original owner's sister arrives to help out, Anthony is impressed with her competence, but will the family step back and relinquish control?\", '2017-11-06', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ecb77f8afad54655a35973983db121d2', '5670e090dd194a7aa76ae8f56d5896bc', 3526895, 13, 'Waterpark Bug-Out: Sandusky, OH', 'Anthony Melchiorri visits Ohio to help a dilapidated indoor waterpark and hotel with the worst bedbug infestation he’s ever seen.', '2017-11-13', 60, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
