{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:45.696093+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 162.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ffb5c8df33004cdc972a13e6bd4af8da', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 796229, 1, 'House of Hello', 'The Sibuna gang return and have a midnight feast in the attic where they find a dollhouse. Victor searches for The Book of Isis – an ancient tome that will tell him how to recreate the Elixir. Nina looks for a new hiding place for the cup, but is it safe?', '2012-01-09', 11, 0.0, 0, '/eiasVNIN3QLeTedsHPxWZh2Xucs.jpg', None, '0dcaffb89b744b568bd0fdc8a130c540', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 5978389, 2, 'House of Dolls', None, None, 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'aaaf4753d125455398ce20f642e20446', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 796230, 3, 'House of Spirits', 'Jerome is blackmailed by a 7th grader. Nina has a dream, inspired by a riddle. Alfie saves the dollhouse, the gang finds out who is blackmailing Jerome, Senkhara tells Nina to find the Mask of Anubis, and Victor is thinks he will find The Book of Isis.', '2012-01-10', 11, 0.0, 0, '/rucCnp1GCgNWHrKEnIz797wZNyn.jpg', None, '675c2da21ed94d5daf64d3031af56381', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 5978391, 4, 'House of Blackmail', None, None, 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, '67d2936c628541b6b0c0fcb135c45b3c', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b' ... 980 parameters truncated ... None, None, '982ba62ee1da4f7d9fd2a8be437ac843', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 796272, 87, 'House of Missions', 'Victor confronts Vera & Patricia tells the Sibunas that Rufus has taken Jerome. Fabian, Patricia & Alfie go to rescue him. Eddie gets into trouble. Fabian, Patricia & Alfie find out why Rufus wants the Mask. Nina unlocks the Mask & learns the truth.', '2012-03-09', 11, 0.0, 0, '/yB1copJcxnGx4EnufAsijCthSzu.jpg', None, 'c2131ad688ae4f3eb4b9e1f30473072b', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 5978199, 88, 'House of Captives', None, None, 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, '08606a9507514247b1c113b37dca6a36', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 1615978, 89, 'House of the Chosen', \"Frobisher Smythe’s trick is revealed. Mara & Poppy wish Jerome hadn’t disappeared. Eddie acts weird. Senkhara is close to getting what she's wanted, & Nina will pay the price. Will the Sibunas save the day? Will the curse be lifted?\", '2012-03-09', 11, 0.0, 0, '/iZD25NduKYOLjjH6akz13xQC6lg.jpg', None, 'b8338788ac124057913ff35d5e303bb3', '606c809d360742bc93bda29c43ca593b', 5978194, 90, 'House of Freedom', None, None, 11, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
