{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:45.945184+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 162.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a8282bdbdc5a476aaafa92c045f356aa', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796273, 1, 'House of Arrivals', 'A new girl named KT begins school, and Eddie recalls seeing her in a vision.', '2013-01-03', 23, 0.0, 0, '/4IXxuNrdzZhlex9pECSKhNnksib.jpg', None, 'cf893f047728443cbdbbf897a1fc3c19', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796305, 2, 'House of Presents', \"Victor's furious when a parcel goes missing. He doesn't realise it's ended up in Amber's pile of birthday presents. Eddie demands that KT come clean about why she's really here.\", '2013-01-03', 23, 0.0, 0, '/7EwpDJO57UqIqoTyQzmgXdKlY4F.jpg', None, 'b6add2cc1f5a4c3694143279970fbfe8', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796275, 3, 'House of Truth', 'Eddie and KT join forces to unlock the mystery of her key. Amber learns details about her bracelet from Alfie. Victor scrambles to find his lost bracelet. Eddie and KT realize Miss Denby also has a key.', '2013-01-10', 23, 0.0, 0, '/oJnmyMF4nhDwV1tZ9yOql6BtCQx.jpg', None, '97dee172dc214869a8a58209a16dcb2e', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796306, 4, 'House of Hieroglyphs', \"Victor's under pressure to find his missing bracelet. Eddie and KT discover that Miss Denby has a key just like KT's - is there more to their new teacher than they first thought?\", '2013-01-10', 23, 0.0, 0, '/jcJElHKhehp8ccGrQPveMkqMZtr.jpg', None, '37eb98d5c2b5471ca52535d8c5b580a0', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb' ... 380 parameters truncated ... '/aiFIn1ZE57pAbVvt021lYx3EIlw.jpg', None, 'b6a3b1c64ac9414a98aea5d006768e8d', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796296, 37, 'House of Hog', \"Alfie convinces KT that he's not a sinner. They rescue Eddie from Team Evil's clutches – only for Alfie himself to be captured. Joy and Mara are forced to work together when they lose Willow's cherished pet hedgehog.\", '2013-04-08', 23, 0.0, 0, '/l6ixAy5VXfzbk6ncDqRNZYCJI9P.jpg', None, '7030323a9a2144b1928b087a2363025d', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796294, 38, 'House of Defeat', \"Eddie and KT find the final artefact and take it to the gatehouse to destroy Ammut – only to realise they have been tricked. An evil Alfie breaks Willow's heart and Joy and Mara bond while coming to her aid.\", '2013-04-09', 23, 0.0, 0, '/cbsvgaU1Qknso5MMjDQS7mgbpr2.jpg', None, '9d6a4a9f210642f7b4b2014fa1b5ac96', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796295, 39, 'House of Ammut', \"As Ammut begins to form, Frobisher demands KT's key – but where is it? Eddie and KT find it on Willow, and realise the purpose of the keys. Jerome explains his feelings to Joy in a letter. But Joy won't read it.\", '2013-04-10', 23, 0.0, 0, '/jD1saVhEct8b4MwpYoxw6KdtIaI.jpg', None, '39a0ef471da04ec1a601fe43991d243b', '710842bdf67349bc906cf0b8c77a06cb', 796297, 40, 'House of Heroes', \"Harriet sacrifices herself as Eddie and KT finally unlock the portal to destroy Ammut and save them all. KT says an emotional goodbye to Frobisher. Joy and Jerome have Mara's blessing, and Alfie has a special gift for Willow.\", '2013-04-11', 23, 0.0, 0, '/42ygzElG44weYyTz3OMsnpkYfIv.jpg', None)"}
