{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:48.444549+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 164.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('74a694ad45894455952dd14dc022e9a2', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278655, 1, 'Episode 1', 'A couple who bought a second property as an investment and saw their management agent change the locks and with hold all of the rent are featured on the show. A housing team from Lewisham Council take a look at the shocking conditions that tenants have to deal with in a cramped, cold flat.', '2015-06-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3823de9a505a475dbce5c16f30ad6eda', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278658, 2, 'Episode 2', \"Ben from Lewisham Council's Rogue Landlord Unit has just a day to try and find a new place for a single mother and her child to live in or they will end up on the streets. Joan is forced to take legal action to evict her tenant who has not paid any rent for a year.\", '2015-07-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '293d93957cb5415686792a78dbf2058c', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278659, 3, 'Episode 3', 'A couple discover that their tenant is using their property to scam students.', '2015-07-08', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'aa6f4c7dfe5f44bb957c0b0b21376684', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278661, 4, 'Episode 4', 'This episode features a couple who discovered their tenant was scamming students.', '2015-07-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c028125365db488e8b5ebc7dfbbba642', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278664, 5, 'Episode 5', 'Squatters move in to an empty community centre for children.', '2015-07-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1707805cac744fb5ab1cfbe0d5abc10a', 'a47cc7fccfed48ac92292a04bf9190d6', 1278666, 6, 'Episode 6', 'The story of Lesley and Mark Irwin, who fell foul of a single mother who turned out to be a confidence trickster - she advertised their home as a ren ... (288 characters truncated) ... l, the couple found themselves locked out of their own property when he changed the locks, and they have been unable to get any help from the police.', '2015-07-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
