{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:48.585030+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 165s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('412fa76be2ea42aaba45d5e6913283d1', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278675, 1, 'Episode 1', \"A Yorkshire landlord has to call in the eviction specialists to remove tenants from a house. Music businessman Donovan hasn't received any rent for s ... (33 characters truncated) ... his costs are spiralling out of control. The courts find in his favour. When he finally does get his property back, he makes an disturbing discovery.\", '2016-03-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7b2f56b9dbe04adc89403e814cbfefea', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278678, 2, 'Episode 2', 'A retired secretary has to visit her tenant in prison in order to retake possession of her buy-to-let flat, and in Manchester and mother looks to housing charity shelter for help when she believes the property she is renting is making her kids ill.', '2016-03-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '38ec89e10dee4cbc9f796dd56aa73321', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278684, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Newbie property developer Alex calls in an eviction specialist after finding that he could be arrested if he tries to oust squatters from the derelict pub he purchased.', '2016-03-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ba455a1d168a459f8927c3fecf074a5e', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278686, 4, 'Episode 4', \"After her tenant claimed that the property was full of damp, a landlord gets a shock when she finally gets inside to inspect the damage. And a landlord's son has to deal with unruly tenants when his father passes away.\", '2016-03-30', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '07e09ee3bf4a464daec31ec38b2bbd1e', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'a72b7206e0214f33b67c7e0df2052338', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278692, 10, 'Episode 10', \"Kate's tenants became anti-social, and now they are suing her for trying to evict them\", '2016-05-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ece04f4f590245b28fb65d9d5e3e41ca', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278693, 11, 'Episode 11', 'Claie and Simon have found their home occupied by a complete stranger who says heard about it on Gumtree. Hamza has been locked out his own house after doing a favour for a friend.', '2016-05-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '54d3f7b68ab844069f9161e3adff201f', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278694, 12, 'Revisited 2', 'Catching up with some of the tenants and landlords from the first series, including a couple who purchased a building in which they hoped to establish a charity for vulnerable children, that became overrun by squatters.', '2016-05-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5fc3176f0fd443bab85e870a0d2a518f', '3c9960adf40c49f3a26416efe1d975d4', 1278695, 13, 'Revisited 3', \"Lesley and Mark's tenant turned out to be a con artist scamming students. Ben investigates an unlicensed boarding property in Deptford, and Nicholas finally returns to his house only to find it booby-trapped.\", '2016-06-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
