{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:48.733822+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 165.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('718dd32338fc4e6a8ac8a6929324704a', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1278698, 1, 'Episode 1', 'A woman fights to reclaim the house she was brought up in from a tenant who owes her money, and a newly-married couple in Chelsea find their buy-to-let dream turn sour.', '2017-03-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '101b5c5329034fb9b63bf7a4d401c879', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1288214, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Alex is hit with a £7,000 bill after his tenant is found to have be running a business from his property. Property developer Jon calls in an eviction specialist to rid a disused tram station of squatters.', '2017-03-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'cbce2169de2d4546950776f650cdbee0', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1281282, 3, 'Episode 3', 'A Watford landlord has a fight on his hands when his long-term tenant suddenly decides to stop paying and unleashes her wrath when  he tries to evict her.', '2017-04-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c7ccfc6912f541f788282b5134cb80c7', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1309649, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Salon owner Wayne offered his employee Katie his home to rent, but is now owed £3,000 with neighbours complaining about a party house.', '2017-05-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7f5bb286d49c423a9cf56a0e630276a3', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327' ... 92 parameters truncated ... None, None, '19c6488ca2954c4dbdf909ce8b5485da', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1323388, 13, 'Revisit', 'Revisiting the victims and villains of the rental market. Rachel rented out her cottage for three months; four years later, her tenant is still there.', '2017-06-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'cdcd0c7b4b7e47619af18661c2885af9', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1365541, 14, 'Revisits 2', 'Craig has been battling family friends to get his property back after three  months of no rent. Owed thousands by Sophia, Terry was relived to get his house back, but then she called the police.', '2017-09-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f70ef90edc404e5cae3bda8e039cd226', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1368523, 15, 'Revisits 3', \"In Bristol, Jon's dream of turning a former tram station into flats was derailed by squatters, has he managed to get things back on track? Two tenants living in dangerous conditions were saving for a deposit, have they hit their target?\", '2017-09-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '87a7d6173386411aa1a22c44cfd81628', '54c5d5e62ecb4ed7bd1ac7b24a5b9327', 1372054, 16, 'Revisits 4', 'Following up on an Essex landlady who had to go to extraordinary lengths to evict her tenants, a landlord whose tenant refused to get the message, and another landlord who cannot move on with his life until he gets his tenants evicted.', '2017-10-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
