{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:48.904530+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 165.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('1d359f060de7463ebc7cb3355598a3e6', '0859793e0eb545dbbf8bc5e7d3321114', 2723905, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Landlords fall foul of two young tenants who are using their rental property as a film set. But the tenants have stopped paying the rent and are now refusing to leave.', '2018-04-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f0ab6ec52478405dbfa4d59ef4ce6133', '0859793e0eb545dbbf8bc5e7d3321114', 2723908, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Landlords fall foul of two young tenants who are using their rental property as a film set. Eviction lawyer Chris receives a shock at an abandoned printworks. Harrow Council tackles a bad case of fly-tipping, and landlord Paul has the fight of his life getting a violent tenant out of his property.', '2018-04-19', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9548d617591e4e9f8fa4a53639bbd591', '0859793e0eb545dbbf8bc5e7d3321114', 2723909, 3, 'Episode 3', 'After offering a former tenant the use of a spare room until she gets back on her feet, a landlord then struggles to evict her, and her partner who a ... (41 characters truncated) ... ad, has to return to London when her tenants stop paying the rent, and Harrow Council officers find 30 mattresses in a flat designed for four people.', '2018-04-26', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7f9f044d3db640c0af8d02f7e61b2970', '0859793e0eb545dbbf8bc5e7d3321114', 2723910, 4, 'Episode 4', 'A doctor needs his lawyer to evict a defaulting tenant from his old family home. Over 30 men found living in an unsafe house refuse to name the landl ... (71 characters truncated) ... faulting tenants have caused extensive damage. A landlady needs to get into her next-door property when her elderly tenant, an extreme hoarder, dies.', '2018-05-03', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '049228d9b9d94d5c96e0b58f7a2698c4', '0859793e0eb545dbbf8bc5e7d3321114' ... 92 parameters truncated ... None, None, '3a35ef6a0e5b4807bc91