{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:49.199772+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 165.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('9e26f15a7caf47f4983865c1c1b6e091', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 2718642, 1, 'Episode 1', 'With the ongoing housing crisis in Britain increasing conflict, eviction specialists attempt to remove nightmare tenants from buildings while elite council teams seek out rogue landlords who provide unsuitable living environments.', '2021-02-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0160d5e80673490cbdd2128cedbbd763', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 2734129, 2, 'Episode 2', 'In Wigan, letting agents Karen and Gemma have no idea that a routine inspection is about to turn into one of the worst hoarding cases. Charlotte, a mother of two small children, is refusing to pay rent because of the poor condition her flat is in.', '2021-06-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '63cea570c60d409aa563394b9c13dd52', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3043524, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Letting agents Karen and Gemma investigate claims of vandalism and anti-social behaviour at a property they manage in Wigan, but when they discover t ... (245 characters truncated) ... re than £3,000 in arrears, but Paul's attempts at evicting him are delayed when the tenant refuses to leave without Paul giving him a good reference.\", '2021-07-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '88c02be7f03a47d1831487dad6aec8f0', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3049353, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Doctor Tariq, with the help of his lawyer, tries to throw out a tenant who refuses to pay. In London, the police discover that there are 30 men living in an unsafe house. They refuse to say who their landlord is.', '2021-07-08', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '02f72bbcd15a4e81802cebde67717d55', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285' ... 44 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'c3f2dd90fd0c449d9565f74b17fbe777', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3331095, 9, 'Episode 9', 'A teacher finally manages to evict an aggressive tenant; a landlord who evicted a squatter follows up with her; a letting agent finds success after disaster.', '2021-11-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '32ed20ccddeb4104875529b41bd27bfc', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3331096, 10, 'Episode 10', 'With the ongoing housing crisis in Britain increasing conflict, eviction specialists attempt to remove nightmare tenants from buildings while elite council teams seek out rogue landlords who provide unsuitable living environments.', '2021-11-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'cc92b4ecc8b04181b26598d16b7cd25c', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3340892, 11, 'Episode 11', 'In Essex, helped by eviction expert, landlord Muhammad starts eviction proceedings on a tenant who owes him over eight thousand pounds in rent and legal fees.', '2021-11-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2bc746e05c6a4e908f1872d148358ea3', '3aef0842131e41f8bb5fbd1a1819f285', 3350603, 12, 'Episode 12', 'Catching up with a landlord two years after he got his property back from a troublesome tenant who refused to leave the property without a fight. Law ... (52 characters truncated) ... nd Sarpong and Ibrahim Farook, get back their 18th century church in the heart of Liverpool so they can launch a ministry and community centre there.', '2021-12-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
