{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:49.761310+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 166.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3b4cd1f4381740f5be68e1e9447da6f9', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1226349, 1, 'Pilot', \"The murder of Bryan Mills' sister launches him into a dangerous mission for revenge against cartel boss Carlos Mejia. A secret US intelligence agency, led by Christina Hart, covertly uses Bryan as bait to capture Mejia, and in the end recruits Bryan to become a part of their team.\", '2017-02-27', 44, 5.9, 11, '/eAfVgoGdyv2OFFPtuPMkCysi2nl.jpg', None, '09c681c733654b1591e05eff81a6e4e3', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270981, 2, 'Ready', \"Bryan gets his first chance in the field but the mission goes bust, resulting in a tragic death. The team uncovers a group of government officials sk ... (1 characters truncated) ... mming off of refugee funds, which also leads Christina to reconnect with a long lost love. Meanwhile, Asha shows up unexpectedly at Bryan's doorstep.\", '2017-03-06', 43, 6.8, 9, '/ecc3q43eH6pxQJCgBzUGx42FiVa.jpg', None, '4a3d7b27395f423cacf79746f14ea144', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270982, 3, 'Off Side', \"Bryan and team search for a suspected terrorist who has been taken, leading them to uncover a deeper plot within their own government. Christina receives troubling news and turns to Harry for support. Asha expresses her concern over Bryan's fixation with Mejia.\", '2017-03-13', 42, 6.6, 7, '/xALSpGP7AARsu7LrgiorCGMwSqH.jpg', None, '5455710dadb74e66bb3726476f973190', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270983, 4, 'Mattie G.', \"Riley's insistence to uncover the truth behind a fatal drug given to war vets results in her asset's child being taken. Bryan defies orders to rescue the girl and uncover the truth. When a break-in at Asha's apartment leaves her shaken, a new neighbor is there to calm her nerves.\", '2017-03-20', 42, 6.3, 6, '/aun7O8d3O3vXPtjO8hzoJbakrKJ.jpg', None, '62e60e77a3a249739b3e506ef919f3e6', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/zY1GndoEQgoYDZO6hMCBZYBUjSe.jpg', None, '9a1f902429944a289c4b934df0297e68', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270986, 7, 'Solo', \"During the team's efforts to thwart a Mejia weapons operation, Bryan is taken. As he relies on his ODNI training to survive, the team attempts a daring rescue. Meanwhile, Bryan and Asha take their relationship to the next level.\", '2017-04-10', 43, 6.714, 7, '/8BAkRCUFb8zrIMh69yumFihnY4x.jpg', None, '54709ad5b3824794a89391b163537237', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270987, 8, 'Leah', 'A Mossad agent from Christina\\'s past asks for her help and protection. First, they need to know who is trying to kill Leah, then the \"why\" becomes rather obvious.', '2017-04-17', 43, 6.7, 6, '/lensEhP0ArMVdZF4INEhjkWJExJ.jpg', None, '0b289c48b23542029eede198c0f13c0a', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1270988, 9, 'Gone', 'The spouse of an FBI agent is kidnapped.  Bryan wants nothing left to chance when Mexico demands the return of Mejia. Asha learns the identify of her friendly neighbor.', '2017-04-24', 43, 6.5, 6, '/oOWpXLWXcilnIT68mLPmd6cOfFv.jpg', None, '2ea7d2c88da1407a8a91a15e1ec2dfb4', '36a87e301f5d454c8bdf8dfd89d2b60e', 1307772, 10, 'I Surrender', \"In the season finale, the FBI threatens to remove Christina from command and Bryan and John lead a rogue mission that risks everything to stop Mejia's associates before.\", '2017-05-01', 42, 6.9, 7, '/6cRc0pIhqJOcgun1yvhPFR4Jlrl.jpg', None)"}
