.jpg', None, 'b3f0eab64b534f8186c6cbdfef3a37d1', 'bad8bc09fb1e41508d3eaf52312e4094', 1465050, 13, 'ACGT', \"When a CIA analyst's son is kidnapped, the team gets help from an unlikely source - another kidnapping victim. Meanwhile, Hart discovers the sinister motive behind the abductions.\", '2018-06-02', 42, 6.0, 2, '/qzTOLBeJp1ooIqTXOyUGyKvJGqD.jpg', None, 'fce597da30314ed484cc68f8a0ee353f', 'bad8bc09fb1e41508d3eaf52312e4094', 1503505, 14, 'Carapace', 'Bryan must protect his cousin when he’s targeted by a powerful crime syndicate. Meanwhile, Kilroy becomes a victim of blackmail', '2018-06-09', 43, 7.0, 1, '/2SGeOgCmxLzDhZK8p7V6HT2Pafr.jpg', None, '843f5184e9b047c4aff29c7cdbad339d', 'bad8bc09fb1e41508d3eaf52312e4094', 1510767, 15, 'Render', \"The daughter of a government official working overseas is taken, and an unexpected suspect derails Bryan's rescue operation.\", '2018-06-23', 43, 6.0, 2, '/y0atbsx4UdG43wA7xkeTnwaBz9U.jpg', None, 'd8531889cf794d948cb13d4d33125565', 'bad8bc09fb1e41508d3eaf52312e4094', 1510769, 16, 'Viceroy', 'With Hart in grave danger, the team must find their own way to stop Ramsey before his plan to assassinate a senator starts a war with international terrorists.', '2018-06-30', 43, 7.7, 3, '/nWdgwE0pCJogqM5Mw22fhrXQRXd.jpg', None)"}
