{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:55.424120+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 1675 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:55.424243+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 171.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('0b9654256b4747be947eb9312d625cb5', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171519, 1, 'Ultra Mixer / Sneeze Busters!', \"Doraemon's latest gadget combines two objects into one. Although it seems like a convenient gadget to have, Nobita and Doraemon can't seem to find the right use for it.\", '1995-01-06', 11, 0.0, 0, '/esVmei7USGFUHuSAX92xX4bgCGZ.jpg', None, 'd55d31fb689e49b480fffc6eef22436a', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171520, 2, 'Demons In! Luck In! Bean / Good-Bye Shizuka Part II', 'On the day of the bean-throwing ceremony, Suneo asks Nobita for help to throw Gian out of his house. Doraemon offers the \"Demons Out! Luck in! Bean,\" which sends things from the inside to the outside.', '1995-01-13', 11, 0.0, 0, '/oPdeOKSkpSazUazrL0sIiFgSlpY.jpg', None, 'b3c0cfa4b1ad40cdb1a16956f933a84c', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171521, 3, \"Gian's Stew / Animal Training Shop Opens!\", 'Upset with Gian\\'s badly cooked home meal, Doraemon takes out the \"Super Gourmet Spice,\" which makes any food delicious.', '1995-01-20', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, '74ffa6af464c4dc8955fb1f462288238', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171522, 4, 'A Warm Snow Fight / Suneo Works At the Goda Family', 'Doraemon lures Nobita out with a gadget that can create snow. The two of them try to see what kinds of snow they can make.', '1995-01-27', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1646fb3e913a460484607c4b841e55c1', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec' ... 476 parameters truncated ... None, None, '535dfb4c4e2c4a30b434574d7e44fcf0', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171563, 45, \"House Kopter / Shizuka's Terrible Birthday\", \"Nobita is jealous of Suneo's camper, so Doraemon gives him a gadget that can make his whole house fly. Nobita invites Shizuka on a trip to the Nashi Highlands, but, they have to rush back home before Nobita's mom finds out what's going on.\", '1995-12-01', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, '72c19540b46c4bd89607bb6ca7e91cde', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171564, 46, 'Vermilion Mixing Stick / Gian Becomes a Panda', 'Doraemon gives Nobita a stick that allows him to take on the traits of those around him, to improve his baseball. Unfortunately, Nobita strikes out at the game, and this infuriates Gian.', '1995-12-08', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'bac39fcba18146e6a6f06a453bcfd843', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171565, 47, 'Gifting Cloth / Invincible! Black Belt Nobita', \"Nobita's mom needs a gift on short notice, so Doraemon helps her out with a cloth that produces gifts for other people. Nobita cooks up a plan to use the cloth to get a videogame console but, the cloth is stolen by Suneo and Gian.\", '1995-12-15', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'de95be5576e848fcb59606c9f3ca3237', '7b0d08db959547b0becf669cd57062ec', 1171566, 48, 'Gian’s Farewell Concert / Dream Director’s Chair', 'Everyone is ecstatic when Gian announces he’ll quit singing. Gian plans one big farewell concert to signal the end. But are Gian’s intentions pure? Or is there an ulterior motive for his announcement?', '1995-12-22', 11, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
