{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:59.899361+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 176.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('7fe41aefd7274dc79e26fbb4c8e98763', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 4939372, 1, 'Bus 447', 'As the MPU moves into new offices, which comes with new boss Inspector Hollis Braun, a call comes in reporting the disappearance of an entire city bu ... (18 characters truncated) ...  on a field trip. The team utilizes a father who tried to stop the kidnapping, as Jason reaches out to an old colleague for assistance in the search.', '2024-03-05', 44, 8.5, 2, '/3cO7le2aCKsfIZ5IjtD1qgZiZIc.jpg', None, 'a003c918ce724eb7a0379407402bdd2d', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5201568, 2, 'Benjamin Franklin', 'The MPU searches for a Benjamin Franklin aficionado after he suspiciously disappears during one of his city tours. Meanwhile, a new forensic scientist is hired and the team attempts to manage her over-eager working style. Jason and Mike try to bond as new partners.', '2024-03-12', 45, 8.0, 1, '/4tc98c3kcn9uIipQOJDU4PU1MxM.jpg', None, 'bc47575092fb4c7d9a979febe825bbef', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5207379, 3, 'Gemma & Isabel', \"A young pregnant woman goes missing one day before her emergency c-section and the adopting mother turns to the MPU to locate her before the baby's life is risked. Meanwhile Jason digs deeper in the car bombing case and meets a disapproving Braun.\", '2024-03-19', 44, 8.0, 1, '/vDvJ9wwmyWmwq902nb1F0AQi93I.jpg', None, '3475a8e56aaa42afbe06b4477d253f41', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5234798, 4, 'Maya', \"The MPU searches for a homeless female teen that disappeared after running away from home and living in Philly's Gayborhood. Kemi is hit especially hard as the team races to find and rescue the missing teen. Jason and Nikki spar over his continued investigation into the car bombing.\", '2024-03-26', 44, 8.0, 1, '/gN0pHKbfzfBmJUPTpbRPB3fGQ8r.jpg', None, '6101917f6405450ebbfa74acb6c2c6d9', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/gH24oqRGsHOFCNBenoVH5YeKiCh.jpg', None, '5fac8aba8be24daa92f2495257497e93', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5274584, 7, '@Kyra', \"A popular travel influencer goes missing and the MPU race to find her as a hurricane rages and a state of emergency is declared. Mike and Wayne get closer as Helen connects with someone unexpectedly in the aftermath of Nikki's bachelorette party.\", '2024-04-16', 44, 9.0, 1, '/q1K76rbZpAwTC2iPbEhQ4flwBHd.jpg', None, '8633cdaaf8cd4d5a9187f2859f125819', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5288937, 8, 'Alexi', 'The MPU is on the case when a young hockey player goes missing during a fight with an opponent on the ice. Kemi is unexpectedly reunited with a face from the past. Nikki runs interference with Braun when Jason dives deeper into the car bombing murders.', '2024-04-30', 44, 8.0, 1, '/5WGoGbFl5AIY6dWVpFsO8CNjAiE.jpg', None, 'cc1d73831e834690a07b140ef7993063', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5288938, 9, 'Paul Miller', \"The MPU is on the case when a young boy claims his father was abducted by aliens as they were stargazing at a remote campsite. Jason and Nikki enlist Mike's help in getting access to Braun's computer files. Kemi and Helen partner up and venture out into the field.\", '2024-05-07', 44, 9.0, 1, '/sruxaGsmp2h8dzGjgRUFigfP1vg.jpg', None, 'a08ddf0437ec46b5b30a72b191a38224', 'cc305df9ee85477885e59ee1cea1a079', 5288939, 10, 'Federal Prisoner #07198F-068P', \"When Wayne goes missing on the day of Nikki & Mike's wedding, the joyous festivities are put on hold as Jason and the MPU race to locate her and finally bring down Inspector Braun and his connection to the car bombing murders.\", '2024-05-14', 44, 9.0, 1, '/zIFo5ZPu6jtnqnqxK5QvKaWJedL.jpg', None)"}
