{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:00.057817+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 176.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('6f640c562e9c4f1591f39f6cc5a93e8b', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 5962990, 1, 'Bella, Genevieve, Amelia, Tally & Kate', 'After a collegiate women’s rowing team goes missing during morning practice on the river, MPU deduce that their boat was sabotaged. When Kemi finds e ... (118 characters truncated) ... gate a rival Polish mobster who may have intel on the girls location. Meanwhile, Jason explores his fear of commitment with Wayne, who’s now paroled.', '2025-03-25', 42, 1.0, 1, '/cKldoXtN7V15BawQpHfSpmRTrkj.jpg', None, 'a3cd81ddeeb44e64977610296c592863', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 5962991, 2, 'Badge #41870', 'When Nikki suddenly goes missing, MPU bands together and discovers that Raina, a criminal who Nikki put away, has escaped and is out for vengeance.', '2025-04-01', 42, 1.0, 1, '/sX3sJEPJgETEGi2hyzmwLUTFHun.jpg', None, '6f8ff95510114222886def3d9070db9f', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 5962992, 3, 'Lay', \"As the MPU struggle to adjust in the wake of tragedy, they are forced to jump into action when a muralist goes missing after painting a piece on a lo ... (38 characters truncated) ... er reveals that he was scheduled to donate his rare bone marrow to his dying brother, who needs surgery within the next 48 hours in order to survive.\", '2025-04-08', 42, 1.0, 1, '/yBatjnsIkCrdClVQvSWJiwZp9wm.jpg', None, 'e2f96571226b4210ad46a47bf4008507', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 6039149, 4, 'Sophie', 'When an Army Lieutenant, and the wife of Houston’s old Army buddy, is kidnapped, MPU suspects a Major who the victim had reported for harassing women ... (30 characters truncated) ... nd Mike learn that the victim and her husband were having marital and financial issues, leading them to uncover a dangerous and deadly weapons trade.', '2025-04-15', 42, 1.0, 1, '/fNnHQTSV2D3ajcgOsMoiL78C0CO.jpg', None, '246f9e9822bf43afabd56cbd7f7f4c5e', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/5gq4W9feDlc8BCI7QO39NxhByl0.jpg', None, '8c646d881da74c98bfdbcf1f984bd646', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 6039150, 7, 'April', \"When a young woman is kidnapped and locked away to freeze to death, the MPU suspects her boyfriend or his father might know more than they're letting on. Meanwhile, Wayne uses her connections to try and get a job at the MPU, and Kemi is put in a dangerous situation while on the case.\", '2025-05-06', 42, 0.0, 0, '/tsMZ38NjJ209x89yd1w9FgBAkat.jpg', None, 'd8c13baa61334f2f996505b9e1a56d91', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 6039151, 8, 'Carmen', \"When a customs broker goes missing, MPU discovers that she is an undercover FBI informant now being forced to transport a little girl over the border ... (94 characters truncated) ... efying the FBI's orders while working alongside Lt. Gabrielle Bennett, Jason goes undercover in order to rescue both the customs broker and the girl.\", '2025-05-13', 41, 3.0, 1, '/vTK7fmEdlC0NqD3a3lbaZOroneF.jpg', None, 'd45e5d54017543bf8d327d6eff104294', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 6039153, 9, 'Burt', 'When a brewery foreman is kidnapped after arguing with his CEO over safety violations, MPU finds evidence that suggests that the victim was taken by  ... (27 characters truncated) ... eer formula. Also, Bennett’s ex, who is also Houston’s step-son, threatens to make her life hell for interrogating his client without representation.', '2025-05-20', 41, 0.0, 0, '/lQ6VXc4ifWw2CVmY8IcxUa2fzzQ.jpg', None, 'a249b691d3034eb6b7e95537acf96f0a', '6164a773289c4c4794c340fa547a2e2c', 6253405, 10, 'Chase', \"When a limousine filled with teenagers, including a Senator's son, is hijacked on the way to prom, MPU discovers that the ex-girlfriend of one of the victims may have been the actual target. Now, Jason, Mike and the team must race to the prom in order to save the girl before it's too late.\", '2025-05-27', 42, 1.0, 1, '/fO2RnOMMyQc4SPLtGmyE9fS9V3a.jpg', None)"}
